s","Proporciona razones de error para mensajes atascados","Se activa mediante alertas de cola de relayer","Se activa mediante solicitudes de usuarios","Soporta varios contextos de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Interroge l''API de relayer pour investiguer les messages bloqués","Compte les réessais de messages","Fournit les raisons d''erreur pour les messages bloqués","Est activé par des alertes de file d''attente de relayer","Est activé par des demandes d''utilisateurs","Prend en charge plusieurs contextes d''applications"],"de":["Abfrage der Relayer-API zur Untersuchung von feststeckenden Nachrichten","Zählt die Wiederholungen von Nachrichten","Bietet Fehlergründe für feststeckende Nachrichten","Wird durch Relayer-Warteschlangen-Alarme aktiviert","Wird durch Benutzeranfragen aktiviert","Unterstützt mehrere Anwendungskontexte"],"pt":["Query da API do relayer para investigar mensagens presas","Análise de contagens de retry e razões de erro","Integração com alertas para detectar problemas de entrega de mensagens","Suporte a múltiplos contextos de aplicação","Análise de filas de mensagens para identificar problemas de desempenho"],"ru":["Запрос к API релейера для расследования заблокированных сообщений","Анализ счетчиков повторных попыток и причин ошибок","Интеграция с оповещениями для обнаружения проблем доставки сообщений","Поддержка нескольких контекстов приложения","Анализ очередей сообщений для выявления проблем производительности"],"ar":["استعلام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للراسل لتحقيق الرسائل العالقة","تحليل عوائد المحاولات وأسباب الأخطاء","دمج مع التنبيهات لاكتشاف مشاكل تسليم الرسائل","دعم سياقات التطبيق المتعددة","تحليل طوابير الرسائل لتحديد مشاكل الأداء"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use investigate-stuck-messages","investigate-stuck-messages setup guide","relayer API query for stuck messages","investigate-stuck-messages vs traditional debugging methods","investigate-stuck-messages install for AI agents","what is investigate-stuck-messages","investigate-stuck-messages alternative for message queue debugging","investigate-stuck-messages for Hyperlane core contracts","debugging stuck messages with investigate-stuck-messages"],"zh":["investigate-stuck-messages","relayer API","卡住的消息","重试次数","错误原因","AI工具","故障排除"],"ja":["investigate-stuck-messages","リレーヤー API","スタックしたメッセージ","リトライ回数","エラー理由","AIエージェント","トラブルシューティング"],"ko":["investigate-stuck-messages","릴레이어 API","메시지 문제","재시도 횟수","오류 이유","AI 툴","문제 해결"],"es":["investigar mensajes atascados","Hyperlane","API de relayer","reintento de mensajes","razones de error","alertas de cola de relayer","solicitudes de usuarios","contextos de aplicaciones"],"fr":["investiguer les messages bloqués","Hyperlane","API de relayer","réessai de messages","raisons d''erreur","alertes de file d''attente de relayer","demandes d''utilisateurs","contextes d''applications"],"de":["feststeckende Nachrichten untersuchen","Hyperlane","Relayer-API","Wiederholung von Nachrichten","Fehlergründe","Relayer-Warteschlangen-Alarme","Benutzeranfragen","Anwendungskontexte"],"pt":["investigar mensagens presas","API do relayer","contagens de retry","razões de erro","alertas de entrega de mensagens","desempenho de filas de mensagens","ferramentas de IA para mensagens","otimização de entrega de mensagens"],"ru":["расследование заблокированных сообщений","API релейера","счетчики повторных попыток","причины ошибок","оповещения о доставке сообщений","производительность очередей сообщений","ИИ агенты для сообщений","оптимизация доставки сообщений"],"ar":["تحقيق الرسائل العالقة","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للراسل","عوائد المحاولات","أسباب الأخطاء","تنبيهات تسليم الرسائل","أداء طوابير الرسائل","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للرسائل","تحسين تسليم الرسائل"]}},"owner":"hyperlane-xyz","repo":"hyperlane-monorepo","repoPath":"hyperlane-xyz/hyperlane-monorepo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.309Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"investigate-stuck-messages","description":"Investigate stuck messages in relayer queue. Use when alerts mention queue length > 0, to diagnose why messages are stuck, or to get message IDs for denylisting.","bodyPreview":"# Investigate Stuck Messages\n\nQuery the relayer API to investigate stuck messages, their retry counts, and error reasons.\n\n## When to Use\n\n1. **Alert-based triggers:**\n   - Alert: \"Known app context relayer queue length > 0 for 40m\"\n   - Any alert mentioning stuck messages in prepare queue\n   - High retry counts for specific app contexts\n\n2. **User request triggers:**\n   - \"Why are messages stuck for [app_context]?\"\n   - \"Investigate stuck messages on [chain]\"\n   - \"What''s causing the queue aler","body":"# Investigate Stuck Messages\n\nQuery the relayer API to investigate stuck messages, their retry counts, and error reasons.\n\n## When to Use\n\n1. **Alert-based triggers:**\n   - Alert: \"Known app context relayer queue length > 0 for 40m\"\n   - Any alert mentioning stuck messages in prepare queue\n   - High retry counts for specific app contexts\n\n2. **User request triggers:**\n   - \"Why are messages stuck for [app_context]?\"\n   - \"Investigate stuck messages on [chain]\"\n   - \"What''s causing the queue alert?\"\n   - Pasting a Grafana alert URL\n\n## Input Parameters\n\n**Option 1: Grafana Alert URL (recommended)**\n\n```\n/investigate-stuck-messages https://abacusworks.grafana.net/alerting/grafana/cdg1ro5hi4vswb/view?tab=instances\n```\n\n**Option 2: Manual specification**\n\n```\n/investigate-stuck-messages app_context=EZETH/renzo-prod remote=linea\n```\n\n| Parameter     | Required | Default    | Description                                                           |\n| ------------- | -------- | ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `alert_url`   | No       | -          | Grafana alert URL (extracts app_context/remote from firing instances) |\n| `app_context` | No\\*     | -          | The app context (e.g., `EZETH/renzo-prod`, `oUSDT/production`)        |\n| `remote`      | No\\*     | -          | Destination chain name (e.g., `linea`, `ethereum`, `arbitrum`)        |\n| `environment` | No       | `mainnet3` | Deployment environment                                                |\n\n\\*Either `alert_url` OR both `app_context` and `remote` must be provided.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Parse Input and Extract Alert Instances\n\n**If Grafana alert URL provided:**\n\n1. Extract the alert UID from the URL (e.g., `cdg1ro5hi4vswb` from `.../alerting/grafana/cdg1ro5hi4vswb/view`)\n\n2. Query Prometheus directly for firing instances using `mcp__grafana__query_prometheus`:\n\n   ```\n   sum by (app_context, remote)(\n       max_over_time(\n           hyperlane_submitter_queue_length{\n               queue_name=\"prepare_queue\",\n               app_context!~\"Unknown|merkly_eth|merkly_erc20|helloworld|velo_message_module\",\n               hyperlane_context!~\"rc|vanguard0|vanguard1|vanguard2|vanguard3|vanguard4|vanguard5\",\n               operation_status!~\"Retry\\\\(ApplicationReport\\\\(.*\\\\)\\\\)|FirstPrepareAttempt\",\n               hyperlane_deployment=\"mainnet3\",\n           }[2m]\n       )\n   ) > 0\n   ```\n\n3. Extract `app_context` and `remote` labels from each result.\n\n**If manual app_context/remote provided:**\n\nUse the provided values directly.\n\n### Step 2: Setup Port-Forward to Relayer\n\nCheck if port 9090 is already in use:\n\n```bash\nlsof -i :9090\n```\n\nIf not in use, start port-forward in background:\n\n```bash\nkubectl port-forward omniscient-relayer-hyperlane-agent-relayer-0 9090 -n mainnet3 &\n```\n\nWait a few seconds for the port-forward to establish.\n\n### Step 3: Get Domain IDs for Chains\n\nLook up domain IDs from the registry:\n\n```bash\ncat node_modules/.pnpm/@hyperlane-xyz+registry@*/node_modules/@hyperlane-xyz/registry/dist/chains/<chain>/metadata.json | jq ''.domainId''\n```\n\nCommon domain IDs:\n\n- ethereum: 1\n- optimism: 10\n- arbitrum: 42161\n- polygon: 137\n- base: 8453\n- unichain: 130\n- avalanche: 43114\n\n### Step 4: Query Relayer API\n\nFor each destination chain, query the relayer API:\n\n```bash\ncurl -s ''http://localhost:9090/list_operations?destination_domain=<DOMAIN_ID>'' > /tmp/<chain>.json\n```\n\nThe response contains operations with:\n\n- `id`: Message ID (H256)\n- `operation.message.sender`: Sender address\n- `operation.message.recipient`: Recipient address\n- `operation.num_retries`: Number of retries (higher = more stuck)\n- `operation.status`: Error status (e.g., `{\"Retry\": \"ErrorEstimatingGas\"}`)\n- `operation.message.origin`: Origin domain ID\n- `operation.message.destination`: Destination domain ID\n- `operation.app_context`: App context name\n\n### Step 5: Filter Messages by App Context\n\nLook up the `app_context` in `rust/main/app-contexts/mainnet_config.json`:\n\n```bash\njq ''.metricAppContexts[] | select(.name == \"<APP_CONTEXT>\")'' rust/main/app-contexts/mainnet_config.json\n```\n\nFilter API results to only include messages where:\n\n- `operation.message.recipient` matches one of the `recipientAddress` values for that destination domain\n\n**Important**: Addresses are padded to 32 bytes (H256 format).\n\n### Step 6: Query GCP Logs for Actual Errors\n\n**Calculate log freshness based on retry count:**\n\nThe relayer uses exponential backoff (see `calculate_msg_backoff` in `rust/main/agents/relayer/src/msg/pending_message.rs`):\n\n| Retries | Backoff/retry | Cumulative Time | Freshness Flag    |\n| ------- | ------------- | --------------- | ----------------- |\n| 1-4     | 5s-1min       | ~2min           | `--freshness=1h`  |\n| 5-24    | 3min          | ~1h             | `--freshness=3h`  |\n| 25-39   | 5-26min       | ~5h             | `--freshness=12h` |\n| 40-49   | 30min-1h      | ~12h            | `--freshness=24h` |\n| 50-60   | 2-22h         | ~35h            | `--freshness=3d`  |\n| 60+     | 22h+          | 35h+            | `--freshness=7d`  |\n\nFor each message ID, query GCP logs with calculated freshness:\n\n```bash\ngcloud logging read ''resource.type=k8s_container AND resource.labels.namespace_name=mainnet3 AND resource.labels.pod_name:omniscient-relayer AND jsonPayload.span.id:<MESSAGE_ID> AND jsonPayload.fields.error:*'' --project=abacus-labs-dev --limit=1 --format=''value(jsonPayload.fields.error)'' --freshness=<CALCULATED_FRESHNESS>\n```\n\nExtract the human-readable error from the response using `sed` (macOS compatible):\n\n```bash\necho \"$raw_error\" | sed -n ''s/.*execution reverted: \\([^\"]*\\)\".*/\\1/p'' | head -1\n```\n\nCommon error patterns:\n\n- `\"execution reverted: Nonce already used\"` → \"Nonce already used\"\n- `\"execution reverted: panic: arithmetic underflow\"` → \"Arithmetic underflow\"\n\n**Note**: Do not use `grep -P` as it''s not available on macOS.\n\n### Step 7: Present Investigation Results\n\nOutput a detailed summary table with **full message IDs** and **both error sources**:\n\n```\n## Investigation Results for [APP_CONTEXT]\n\n### Summary\n- Total stuck messages: X\n- Destinations affected: [list]\n- Reprepare reasons: ErrorEstimatingGas (N), CouldNotFetchMetadata (M)\n\n### Messages\n\n| Message ID | Retries | Reprepare Reason | Error | Origin |\n|------------|---------|------------------|-----------|--------|\n| `0xaa18ebc1c79345e6d24984a0b9a5ab66c968d128d46b2357b641e56e71b8d30c` | 47 | ErrorEstimatingGas | Nonce already used | optimism |\n| `0xd6aeef7c092a88aa23ad53227aeb834ae731d059b3ce749db8451e761f3f15ac` | 47 | ErrorEstimatingGas | Nonce already used | arbitrum |\n\n**Important**: Always show the full 66-character message ID (0x + 64 hex chars). Do not truncate.\n\n### Error Analysis\n[Explain based on the actual log errors found]\n\n### Next Steps\nTo denylist these messages, run:\n/denylist-stuck-messages <message_ids> app_context=APP_CONTEXT\n```\n\n**Column definitions:**\n\n- **Reprepare Reason**: From `operation.status` in relayer API (e.g., ErrorEstimatingGas, CouldNotFetchMetadata)\n- **Error**: Actual revert reason from GCP logs (e.g., \"Nonce already used\", \"Arithmetic underflow\")\n\n### Step 8: Output Denylist Command\n\nAt the end of the investigation results, output the full denylist command:\n\n```\n### Next Steps\nTo denylist, run:\n/denylist-stuck-messages 0xaa18ebc1c79345e6d24984a0b9a5ab66c968d128d46b2357b641e56e71b8d30c 0xd6aeef7c092a88aa23ad53227aeb834ae731d059b3ce749db8451e761f3f15ac app_context=APP_CONTEXT\n```\n\nAlways use full message IDs, never truncated.\n\n## Error Status Reference\n\n| Status                   | Meaning                                 | Action                                   |\n| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `ErrorEstimatingGas`     | Gas estimation failed (contract revert) | Usually denylist - contract won''t accept |\n| `CouldNotFetchMetadata`  | Can''t get ISM metadata                  | Check validators, may resolve itself     |\n| `ApplicationReport(...)` | App-specific error                      | Check the specific error message         |\n| `GasPaymentNotFound`     | No IGP payment                          | May need manual relay with gas           |\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- **Port-forward fails**: Check kubectl context: `kubectl config current-context`\n- **No messages found**: Queue may have cleared; alert may be stale\n- **API returns error**: Check relayer pod: `kubectl get pods -n mainnet3 | grep relayer`\n- **App context not found**: May be new/custom; ask user for sender/recipient addresses\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `kubectl` configured with access to mainnet cluster\n- Grafana MCP server connected (for alert URL parsing)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:27.200Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Relayer API Agents needing to diagnose and resolve stuck message issues in real-time.","zh":"适用于需要实时诊断和解决卡住消息问题的Relayer API代理。","ja":"Relayer APIエージェントが実時間に詰まったメッセージの問題を診断して解決するのに適しています。","ko":"실시간으로 메시지 문제를 진단하고 해결해야 하는 Relayer API 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de API de Relayer que necesitan diagnosticar y resolver problemas de mensajes atascados en tiempo real.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents API Relayer qui ont besoin de diagnostiquer et de résoudre les problèmes de messages bloqués en temps réel.","de":"Ideal für Relayer-API-Agents, die stuckierte Nachrichtenprobleme in Echtzeit diagnostizieren und lösen müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de API de Relayer que precisam diagnosticar e resolver problemas de mensagens presas em tempo real.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Relayer API, которым необходимо диагностировать и решать проблемы застрявших сообщений в реальном времени.","ar":"مثالية لوكلاء API Relayer الذين يحتاجون إلى تشخيص ومعالجة مشاكل الرسائل العالقة في الوقت الفعلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to query the relayer API, retrieving retry counts and error reasons for stuck messages, leveraging alert-based triggers and user request triggers to optimize app context performance and resolve queue alerts via API introspection and error analysis.","zh":"赋予代理查询relayer API的能力，检索卡住消息的重试次数和错误原因，利用基于警报的触发器和用户请求触发器来优化应用程序上下文性能，并通过API内省和错误分析解决队列警报。","ja":"エージェントがrelayer APIを照会し、詰まったメッセージのリトライ回数とエラー理由を取得できるようにし、警報ベースのトリガーとユーザー要求トリガーを利用してアプリケーションコンテキストのパフォーマンスを最適化し、APIの内省とエラー分析を介してキューの警報を解決します。","ko":"에이전트가 릴레이 API를 쿼리하여 메시지의 재시도 횟수와 오류 이유를 검색하고, 경고 기반 트리거와 사용자 요청 트리거를 활용하여 애플리케이션 컨텍스트 성능을 최적화하며, API 내省과 오류 분석을 통해 큐 경고를 해결할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a consultar la API de Relayer, recuperando recuentos de reintentos y razones de error para mensajes atascados, aprovechando desencadenadores basados en alertas y desencadenadores de solicitud de usuario para optimizar el rendimiento del contexto de la aplicación y resolver alertas de cola mediante introspección de API y análisis de errores.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger l''API Relayer, en récupérant les comptes de réessais et les raisons d''erreur pour les messages bloqués, en exploitant les déclencheurs basés sur les alertes et les déclencheurs de demande d''utilisateur pour optimiser les performances du contexte d''application et résoudre les alertes de file d''attente via l''introspection de l''API et l''analyse des erreurs.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, die Relayer-API abzufragen, Wiederholungszahlen und Fehlergründe für stuckierte Nachrichten abzurufen, indem sie triggerbasierte Warnungen und Benutzerauftragstrigger nutzen, um die Leistung des App-Kontexts zu optimieren und Warteschlangenwarnungen über API-Introspektion und Fehleranalyse zu lösen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a consultar a API de relayer, recuperando contagens de retry e razões de erro para mensagens presas, aproveitando gatilhos baseados em alertas e gatilhos de solicitação de usuário para otimizar o desempenho do contexto do aplicativo e resolver alertas de fila via introspecção da API e análise de erros.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность запроса API relayer, извлекая счетчики повторных попыток и причины ошибок для застрявших сообщений, используя триггеры на основе оповещений и триггеры запросов пользователя для оптимизации производительности контекста приложения и решения оповещений о длине очереди через интроспекцию API и анализ ошибок.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من استفسار واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Relayer، واسترجاع عدات إعادة المحاولة وأسباب الخطأ للرسائل العالقة، والاستفادة من الأنشطة المبنية على التنبيهات وعمليات الطلب من المستخدم لتحسين أداء سياق التطبيق ومعالجة تنبيهات الطوابير عبر التفتيش عن واجهة برمجة التطبيقات وتحليل الأخطاء."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging stuck messages in prepare queues","Investigating high retry counts for specific app contexts","Resolving relayer queue length alerts"],"zh":["调试准备队列中的卡住消息","调查特定应用程序上下文的高重试次数","解决relayer队列长度警报"],"ja":["準備キュー内の詰まったメッセージのデバッグ","特定のアプリケーションコンテキストの高リトライ回数の調査","リレーキューの長さの警報の解決"],"ko":["준비 큐에 있는 메시지 문제를 디버깅하는 것"," 특정 애플리케이션 컨텍스트에 대한 높은 재시도 횟수를 조사하는 것","릴레이 큐 길이 경고를 해결하는 것"],"es":["Depuración de mensajes atascados en colas de preparación","Investigación de recuentos de reintento altos para contextos de aplicación específicos","Resolución de alertas de longitud de cola de Relayer"],"fr":["Débogage des messages bloqués dans les files d''attente de préparation","Enquête sur les comptes de réessais élevés pour des contextes d''application spécifiques","Résolution des alertes de longueur de file d''attente de Relayer"],"de":["Fehlersuche bei stuckierten Nachrichten in Vorbereitungsqueues","Untersuchung hoher Wiederholungszahlen für bestimmte App-Kontexte","Auflösung von Relayer-Warteschlangenlängen-Alerts"],"pt":["Depuração de mensagens presas em filas de preparação","Investigação de contagens de retry altas para contextos de aplicativo específicos","Resolução de alertas de comprimento de fila de relayer"],"ru":["Отладка застрявших сообщений в очередях подготовки","Изучение высоких счетчиков повторных попыток для конкретных контекстов приложения","Решение оповещений о длине очереди relayer"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء الرسائل العالقة في طوابير التحضير","تحقيق 高Retry العدات لمواقف التطبيق النوعية","معالجة تنبيهات طول طابور Relayer"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires relayer API access","Dependent on alert-based triggers and user request triggers"],"zh":["需要relayer API访问","依赖于警报触发器和用户请求触发器"],"ja":["relayer APIへのアクセスが必要","警報トリガーとユーザー要求トリガーに依存"],"ko":["릴레이 API 액세스가 필요","경고 트리거와 사용자 요청 트리거에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de Relayer","Dependiente de desencadenadores basados en alertas y desencadenadores de solicitud de usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API Relayer","Dépendante des déclencheurs basés sur les alertes et des déclencheurs de demande d''utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Relayer-API","Abhängig von triggerbasierten Warnungen und Benutzerauftragstriggern"],"pt":["Exige acesso à API de relayer","Depende de gatilhos baseados em alertas e gatilhos de solicitação de usuário"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API relayer","Зависит от триггеров на основе оповещений и триггеров запросов пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Relayer","يعتمد على الأنشطة المبنية على التنبيهات وعمليات الطلب من المستخدم"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"2c12df2a52c8e020ad99cdfaefec86e0ac9350f10fcb85d864b7115700fede26","qualityScore":60}');
