dução de tokens em 99,6%"],"ru":["Принимает аргументы командной строки (--url)","Вызывает инструмент MCP (fetch__fetch)","Возвращает результаты","Демонстрирует минимальный шаблон навыка на основе CLI","Оптимизирован для Claude Code","Сокращение токенов на 99,6%"],"ar":["يقبل الحجج سطر الأوامر (--url)","يدعو أداة MCP (fetch__fetch)","يعيد النتائج","يظهر النمط الأدنى للمهارة المستندة إلى سطر الأوامر","مُحسَّن ل كلود كود","تقليل رموز البنود بنسبة 99,6%"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use simple-fetch","simple-fetch setup guide","what is simple-fetch","simple-fetch alternative","simple-fetch vs Claude Code","simple-fetch install","simple-fetch CLI arguments","MCP tool fetch__fetch","custom skill creation with simple-fetch"],"zh":["Simple Fetch技能","AI工具","MCP代码执行","令牌减少","多种传输方式","沙箱化","CLI参数"],"ja":["Simple Fetchスキル","AIエージェント","MCPコード実行","トークン削減","マルチトランスポート","サンドボックス化","CLIパラメーター"],"ko":["Simple Fetch Skill","AI 도구","MCP 코드 실행","토큰 감소","여러 전송 방식","샌드박스화","CLI 매개변수"],"es":["simple-fetch","agentes de inteligencia artificial","MCP","CLI","fetch de contenido","patrón de habilidad","competencias de agente","desarrollo de agentes","inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["simple-fetch","outils d''intelligence artificielle","MCP","CLI","récupération de contenu","modèle de compétence","compétences d''outils","développement d''outils","intelligence artificielle"],"de":["simple-fetch","KI-Agents","MCP","CLI","Inhaltsabruf","Fähigkeitsmuster","Agentenfähigkeiten","Agentenentwicklung","Künstliche Intelligenz"],"pt":["simple fetch","ferramenta de extração de conteúdo","CLI","MCP","Claude Code","desenvolvimento de skills","extração de conteúdo de URLs","padrão de habilidade mínimo"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Simple Fetch","инструмент для извлечения контента","CLI","MCP","Claude Code","разработка навыков","извлечение контента из URL","минимальный шаблон навыка"],"ar":["العميل البسيط للحصول على المحتوى","أداة لاستخراج المحتوى","سطر الأوامر","MCP","كلود كود","إنشاء مهارات","استخراج المحتوى من عناوين URL","النمط الأدنى للمهارة"]}},"owner":"yoloshii","repo":"mcp-code-execution-enhanced","repoPath":"yoloshii/mcp-code-execution-enhanced","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.310Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"simple-fetch","description":"Basic MCP skill demonstrating CLI-based execution pattern for fetching URL content","bodyPreview":"# Simple Fetch Skill\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this Skill to:\n- Learn the basic skill pattern\n- Fetch content from a URL\n- Use as a template for creating custom skills\n\nThis is a **demonstration skill** showing the minimal CLI-based pattern.\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nDemonstrates the core skill pattern:\n1. Accept CLI arguments (--url)\n2. Call an MCP tool (fetch__fetch)\n3. Return result\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen you need to fetch content from a URL, execute:\n\n```bash\ncd /home/khitomer/Projects","body":"# Simple Fetch Skill\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this Skill to:\n- Learn the basic skill pattern\n- Fetch content from a URL\n- Use as a template for creating custom skills\n\nThis is a **demonstration skill** showing the minimal CLI-based pattern.\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nDemonstrates the core skill pattern:\n1. Accept CLI arguments (--url)\n2. Call an MCP tool (fetch__fetch)\n3. Return result\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen you need to fetch content from a URL, execute:\n\n```bash\ncd /home/khitomer/Projects/mcp-code-execution-enhanced\n\nuv run python -m runtime.harness scripts/simple_fetch.py \\\n    --url \"https://example.com\"\n```\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `--url`: The URL to fetch (required)\n\n### Example Usage\n\n```bash\n# Fetch a webpage\nuv run python -m runtime.harness scripts/simple_fetch.py \\\n    --url \"https://docs.example.com/api\"\n\n# Fetch documentation\nuv run python -m runtime.harness scripts/simple_fetch.py \\\n    --url \"https://github.com/owner/repo/README.md\"\n```\n\n## Expected Output\n\nThe skill returns the fetched content and prints:\n- Success message with byte count\n- Or error message if fetch fails\n\n## MCP Servers Required\n\nConfigure a fetch-capable MCP server in `mcp_config.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"fetch\": {\n      \"type\": \"stdio\",\n      \"command\": \"uvx\",\n      \"args\": [\"mcp-server-fetch\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Technical Notes\n\n- **Pattern**: CLI args → MCP call → Result\n- **Token cost**: ~110 tokens (discover + read + execute)\n- **Time**: <10 seconds\n- **Immutable**: Parameters via CLI, no file editing needed\n\nThis skill demonstrates the foundation for creating more complex MCP workflows.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:27.993Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for CLI-based AI Agents needing basic content fetching capabilities from URLs.","zh":"适用于需要从URL获取基本内容的基于CLI的AI代理。","ja":"CLIベースのAIエージェントがURLから基本的なコンテンツを取得する機能が必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"URL에서 기본 콘텐츠를 가져오는 기능이 필요한 CLI 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en CLI que necesitan capacidades básicas de recuperación de contenido desde URLs.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA basés sur CLI nécessitant des capacités de récupération de contenu de base à partir d''URL.","de":"Ideal für CLI-basierte KI-Agents, die grundlegende Inhaltsabruf-Funktionen von URLs benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em CLI que precisam de capacidades básicas de fetch de conteúdo a partir de URLs.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе CLI, требующих базовых возможностей извлечения контента из URL.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي القائم على CLI الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات استرجاع المحتوى الأساسية من عناوين URL."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch content from URLs using CLI arguments and the MCP tool fetch__fetch, enabling seamless data retrieval over HTTP protocols.","zh":"赋予代理使用CLI参数和MCP工具fetch__fetch从URL获取内容的能力，实现通过HTTP协议的无缝数据检索。","ja":"CLIの引数とMCPツールのfetch__fetchを使用して、URLからコンテンツを取得し、HTTPプロトコルを介したシームレスなデータの取得を可能にします。","ko":"CLI 인수와 MCP 도구의 fetch__fetch를 사용하여 URL에서 콘텐츠를 가져올 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 HTTP 프로토콜을 통해 무결점 데이터 수신을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recuperar contenido desde URLs utilizando argumentos de CLI y la herramienta MCP fetch__fetch, lo que permite una recuperación de datos sin problemas a través de protocolos HTTP.","fr":"Équipe les agents pour récupérer du contenu à partir d''URL en utilisant des arguments de CLI et l''outil MCP fetch__fetch, permettant une récupération de données transparente sur les protocoles HTTP.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Inhalte von URLs mithilfe von CLI-Argumenten und dem MCP-Tool fetch__fetch abzurufen, ermöglicht so eine nahtlose Datenabfrage über HTTP-Protokolle.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar conteúdo a partir de URLs usando argumentos CLI e a ferramenta MCP fetch__fetch, permitindo a recuperação de dados sem interrupções sobre protocolos HTTP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать контент из URL с помощью аргументов CLI и инструмента MCP fetch__fetch, обеспечивая бесшовное получение данных по протоколам HTTP.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على استرجاع المحتوى من عناوين URL باستخدام حجة CLI وأداة MCP fetch__fetch، مما يتيح استرجاع البيانات بدون انقطاع عبر بروتوكولات HTTP."},"useCases":{"en":["Fetching web page content for analysis","Retrieving data from RESTful APIs","Downloading files from remote servers"],"zh":["为分析获取网页内容","从RESTful API检索数据","从远程服务器下载文件"],"ja":["分析のためにWebページのコンテンツを取得する","RESTful APIからデータを取得する","リモートサーバーからファイルをダウンロードする"],"ko":["분석을 위한 웹 페이지 콘텐츠 가져오기","RESTful API에서 데이터 가져오기","원격 서버에서 파일 다운로드"],"es":["Recuperación de contenido de páginas web para análisis","Recuperación de datos de APIs RESTful","Descarga de archivos desde servidores remotos"],"fr":["Récupération de contenu de pages Web pour analyse","Récupération de données à partir d''API RESTful","Téléchargement de fichiers à partir de serveurs distants"],"de":["Abruf von Webseiteninhalten für Analysezwecke","Abruf von Daten aus RESTful-APIs","Herunterladen von Dateien von Remote-Servern"],"pt":["Buscar conteúdo de página da web para análise","Recuperar dados de APIs RESTful","Baixar arquivos de servidores remotos"],"ru":["Извлечение контента веб-страниц для анализа","Получение данных из RESTful API","Загрузка файлов с удаленных серверов"],"ar":["استرجاع محتوى صفحة الويب للتحليل","استرجاع البيانات من واجهات برمجة التطبيقات RESTful","تنزيل الملفات من الخوادم عن بعد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires CLI access","Dependent on MCP tool fetch__fetch","Limited to HTTP protocol"],"zh":["需要CLI访问","依赖于MCP工具fetch__fetch","仅限于HTTP协议"],"ja":["CLIへのアクセスが必要","MCPツールのfetch__fetchに依存している","HTTPプロトコルに限定される"],"ko":["CLI 접근이 필요","MCP 도구의 fetch__fetch에 의존","HTTP 프로토콜만 사용 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso a CLI","Dependiente de la herramienta MCP fetch__fetch","Limitado al protocolo HTTP"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à CLI","Dépendant de l''outil MCP fetch__fetch","Limité au protocole HTTP"],"de":["Benötigt CLI-Zugang","Abhängig vom MCP-Tool fetch__fetch","Begrenzt auf HTTP-Protokoll"],"pt":["Requer acesso CLI","Dependente da ferramenta MCP fetch__fetch","Limitado ao protocolo HTTP"],"ru":["Требует доступа CLI","Зависит от инструмента MCP fetch__fetch","Ограничен протоколом HTTP"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى CLI","يعتمد على أداة MCP fetch__fetch","محدود ببروتوكول HTTP"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"8bbbb60d9783b4d11a232447d7d7f38843f5f44494eb8b3b2b7365f90460c808","qualityScore":60}');
