INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('rayven122/tumiki/tumiki-manager-architecture', 'tumiki-manager-architecture', 'rayven122', 'tumiki', 'community', 'tumiki-manager-architecture rayven122 tumiki community The tumiki-manager-architecture skill helps developers manage monorepos with a feature-based structure, leveraging Server Components and Server Actions for improved performance. It benefits developers working with complex projects. Tumiki Manager Architecture是一种基于Feature-Based、RSC-First和Server Actions的AIエージェント架构，旨在提升开发效率和性能 Tumiki Manager Architectureは、Feature-Based、RSC-First、Server Actionsを活用したAIエージェントアーキテクチャで、開発効率とパフォーマンスを向上させる Tumiki Manager Architecture는 Feature-Based, RSC-First, Server Actions를 기반으로 하는 AI 에이전트 아키텍처로, 개발 효율과 성능을 향상 tumiki-manager-architecture es una arquitectura de monorepo basada en características que utiliza tecnologías como React y Server Actions tumiki-manager-architecture est une architecture de monorepo basée sur les fonctionnalités qui utilise des technologies comme React et Server Actions tumiki-manager-architecture ist eine feature-basierte Monorepo-Architektur, die Technologien wie React und Server Actions verwendet O tumiki-manager-architecture é uma arquitetura de monorepo baseada em recursos que combina features/, Server Components e Server Actions para melhorar o desempenho da aplicação tumiki-manager-architecture - это архитектура монорепозитория на основе функций, которая объединяет features/, Server Components и Server Actions для улучшения производительности приложения تُمثّل tumiki-manager-architecture هندسة مونوريبو تعتمد على الميزات التي تجمع بين features/، Server Components و Server Actions لتحسين أداء التطبيق how to use tumiki-manager-architecture tumiki-manager-architecture setup guide tumiki-manager-architecture vs monorepo tumiki-manager-architecture install what is tumiki-manager-architecture tumiki-manager-architecture alternative tumiki-manager-architecture and Server Components tumiki-manager-architecture monorepo management tumiki-manager-architecture RSC-First approach tumiki-manager-architecture Turborepo integration AIエージェント Tumiki Manager Architecture Feature-Based RSC-First Server Actions Turborepo Bulletproof React Next.js 15+ AI开发 架构设计 Uses a feature-based structure with `features/` directory for domain-level cohesion Employs Server Components as the default for improved performance Utilizes Server Actions for simplified form processing Supports package splitting via Turborepo for efficient dependency management Leverages RSC-First approach for optimized Server Component usage Follows Bulletproof React principles for robust and maintainable code tumiki-manager-architecture is a monorepo management approach using a feature-based structure, Server Components, and Server Actions for efficient project organization and development.');
