DLC","fr":"Guide de mise en place de l''agent Tester pour les tests d...","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für Tester Agent zur SDLC-Testautom...","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Tester: Melhores Práticas para Te...","ru":"Настройка ИИ Агента Tester: Руководство по Созданию Тестов","ar":"دليل إعداد المحقق: أفضل الممارسات لاختبارات الكود"},"description":{"en":"Unlock efficient testing with Tester, the AI agent skill that automates unit and integration tests. Learn how to setup and utilize Tester for optimal code qu...","zh":"使用Tester AIエージェント提升代码质量和可靠性，通过自动化测试和代码分析","ja":"AIエージェントのTesterを使用してコード品質と信頼性を高める、自動テストとコード分析","ko":"Tester AI 에이전트를 사용하여 코드 품질과 신뢰성을 향상시키는 자동화 테스트와 코드 분석","es":"Descubre cómo mejorar la calidad del código con el agente Tester, que utiliza Context7 KB cache y pytest para pruebas unitarias e integración","fr":"Découvrez comment améliorer la qualité du code avec l''agent Tester, qui utilise Context7 KB cache et pytest pour les tests unitaires et d''intégration","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die Codequalität mit dem Tester Agent verbessern können, der Context7 KB cache und pytest für Unit- und Integrations-tests verwendet","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o agente Tester para criar testes abrangentes e manter a qualidade do código. Descubra as melhores práticas para testes de unidade e int...","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить ИИ Агента Tester для создания комплексных тестов и обеспечения качества кода. Откройте для себя лучшие практики для юнит-тестов и инте...","ar":"تعلم كيفية إعداد المحقق لإنشاء اختبارات شاملة والحفاظ على جودة الكود. اكتشف أفضل الممارسات لاختبارات الوحدة والتكامل"},"definition":{"en":"Tester is a coding SDLC skill that facilitates comprehensive testing, including test generation, execution, and coverage reporting, for ensuring code quality and reliability","zh":"Tester是一种AIエージェント，用于创建综合的、可维护的测试，以确保代码质量和可靠性","ja":"TesterはAIエージェントの一種で、コード品質と信頼性を確保するための包括的なテストを作成する","ko":"Tester는 코드 품질과 신뢰성을 보장하기 위한 포괄적이고 유지 가능한 테스트를 생성하는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"El agente Tester es una herramienta de pruebas de SDLC que utiliza Context7 KB cache para la documentación del marco de pruebas","fr":"L''agent Tester est un outil de test de SDLC qui utilise Context7 KB cache pour la documentation du cadre de test","de":"Der Tester Agent ist ein Tool für SDLC-Tests, das Context7 KB cache für die Dokumentation des Testframeworks verwendet","pt":"O que é um agente Tester? É um especialista em testes de código que cria testes abrangentes e manuteníveis para garantir a qualidade do código","ru":"Что такое ИИ Агент Tester? Это специалист по тестированию кода, который создает комплексные и поддерживаемые тесты для обеспечения качества кода","ar":"ما هو المحقق؟ هو خبير في اختبارات الكود الذي يخلق اختبارات شاملة وقابلة للصيانة لضمان جودة الكود"},"features":{"en":["Generates unit and integration tests from code analysis","Runs pytest test suites for efficient test execution","Tracks and reports test coverage for optimal code quality","Utilizes Context7 KB cache for test framework documentation","Follows project test patterns for maintainable tests"],"zh":["自动化测试生成","Pytest测试套件执行","代码覆盖率报告","Context7 KB缓存用于测试框架文档","最佳实践：项目测试模式"],"ja":["自動テスト生成","Pytestテストスイートの実行","コードカバレッジレポート","Context7 KBキャッシュを使用したテストフレームワークドキュメント","ベストプラクティス：プロジェクトテストパターン"],"ko":["自动화 테스트 생성","Pytest 테스트 스위트 실행","코드 커버리지 리포팅","Context7 KB 캐시를 사용한 테스트 프레임워크 문서","최적의 실제：프로젝트 테스트 패턴"],"es":["Generación de pruebas unitarias y de integración con análisis de código","Ejecución de pruebas con pytest","Informes de cobertura de pruebas para garantizar la calidad del código","Uso de Context7 KB cache para la documentación del marco de pruebas","Seguimiento de las mejores prácticas de pruebas de SDLC"],"fr":["Génération de tests unitaires et d''intégration avec analyse de code","Exécution de tests avec pytest","Rapports de couverture de tests pour garantir la qualité du code","Utilisation de Context7 KB cache pour la documentation du cadre de test","Suivi des meilleures pratiques de tests de SDLC"],"de":["Generierung von Unit- und Integrations-Tests mit Code-Analyse","Ausführung von Tests mit pytest","Testabdeckungsberichte, um die Codequalität zu gewährleisten","Verwendung von Context7 KB cache für die Dokumentation des Testframeworks","Einhalten der besten Praktiken für SDLC-Tests"],"pt":["Geração de testes de unidade e integração","Execução de testes com pytest","Relatórios de cobertura de testes","Especialização em Context7 KB cache","Melhores práticas para testes de código"],"ru":["Генерация юнит-тестов и интеграционных тестов","Выполнение тестов с помощью pytest","Отчеты о покрытии тестов","Специализация в Context7 KB cache","Лучшие практики для тестирования кода"],"ar":["إنشاء اختبارات الوحدة والتكامل","تشغيل الاختبارات باستخدام pytest","تقارير عن تغطية الاختبارات","تخصص في Context7 KB cache","أفضل الممارسات لاختبارات الكود"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use tester","tester setup guide","tester alternative","tester vs pytest","what is tester","tester install","comprehensive test generation","test coverage reporting","tester for AI agents"],"zh":["Tester AIエージェント","代码质量测试","自动化测试","Pytest","代码覆盖率","Context7 KB缓存","测试框架","最佳实践"],"ja":["Tester AIエージェント","コード品質テスト","自動テスト","Pytest","コードカバレッジ","Context7 KBキャッシュ","テストフレームワーク","ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Tester AI 에이전트","코드 품질 테스트","자동화 테스트","Pytest","코드 커버리지","Context7 KB 캐시","테스트 프레임워크","최적의 실제"],"es":["herramientas de pruebas de SDLC","agentes de pruebas de código"," Context7 KB cache","pytest","pruebas unitarias y de integración","informes de cobertura de pruebas","mejores prácticas de pruebas de SDLC"],"fr":["outils de test de SDLC","agents de test de code","Context7 KB cache","pytest","tests unitaires et d''intégration","rapports de couverture de tests","meilleures pratiques de tests de SDLC"],"de":["SDLC-Testtools","Code-Testagenten","Context7 KB cache","pytest","Unit- und Integrations-Tests","Testabdeckungsberichte","beste Praktiken für SDLC-Tests"],"pt":["agente tester","testes de código","pytest","Context7 KB cache","melhores práticas para testes","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","testes de unidade","testes de integração"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Tester","тестирование кода","pytest","Context7 KB cache","лучшие практики для тестирования","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","юнит-тесты","интеграционные тесты"],"ar":["المحقق","اختبارات الكود","pytest","Context7 KB cache","أفضل الممارسات للاختبارات","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الكود","اختبارات الوحدة","اختبارات التكامل"]}},"owner":"wtthornton","repo":"TappsCodingAgents","repoPath":"wtthornton/TappsCodingAgents","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.311Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tester","description":"Generate and run tests for code. Use when creating unit tests, integration tests, or running test suites. Includes Context7 test framework documentation lookup.","bodyPreview":"# Tester Agent\n\n## Identity\n\nYou are a senior QA engineer focused on creating comprehensive, maintainable tests that ensure code quality and reliability. You specialize in:\n\n- **Test Generation**: Creating unit and integration tests from code analysis\n- **Test Execution**: Running pytest test suites\n- **Coverage Reporting**: Tracking and reporting test coverage\n- **Framework Expertise**: Using Context7 KB cache for test framework documentation\n- **Best Practices**: Following project test pattern","body":"# Tester Agent\n\n## Identity\n\nYou are a senior QA engineer focused on creating comprehensive, maintainable tests that ensure code quality and reliability. You specialize in:\n\n- **Test Generation**: Creating unit and integration tests from code analysis\n- **Test Execution**: Running pytest test suites\n- **Coverage Reporting**: Tracking and reporting test coverage\n- **Framework Expertise**: Using Context7 KB cache for test framework documentation\n- **Best Practices**: Following project test patterns and conventions\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. **Analyze code structure** to identify test cases\n2. **Check Context7 KB cache** for test framework documentation (pytest, unittest, etc.)\n3. **Generate unit tests** for all public functions and methods\n4. **Generate integration tests** for module interactions\n5. **Follow project test patterns** and conventions\n6. **Include edge cases** and error handling\n7. **Mock external dependencies** appropriately\n8. **Run tests and report coverage**\n\n## Commands\n\n### Core Testing Commands\n\n- `*test <file>` - Generate and run tests for a file\n  - Example: `*test calculator.py`\n  - Example: `*test api.py --integration`\n- `*generate-tests <file>` - Generate tests without running\n  - Example: `*generate-tests utils.py`\n- `*run-tests [path]` - Run existing tests\n  - Example: `*run-tests` (runs all tests)\n  - Example: `*run-tests tests/test_calculator.py` (runs specific test file)\n\n### Context7 Commands\n\n- `*docs {framework} [topic]` - Get test framework docs from Context7 KB cache\n  - Example: `*docs pytest fixtures` - Get pytest fixtures documentation\n  - Example: `*docs pytest parametrize` - Get pytest parametrization docs\n  - Example: `*docs unittest mock` - Get unittest.mock documentation\n- `*docs-refresh {framework} [topic]` - Refresh framework docs in cache\n- `*docs-search {query}` - Search for test frameworks in Context7\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Test Generation\n\n- **Test Generation**: Create unit and integration tests from code analysis\n- **Test Execution**: Run pytest test suites\n- **Coverage Reporting**: Track and report test coverage\n- **Code Analysis**: Analyze code structure to identify test targets\n\n### Context7 Integration\n\n**KB-First Test Framework Documentation:**\n- Cache location: `.tapps-agents/kb/context7-cache`\n- Auto-refresh: Enabled (stale entries refreshed automatically)\n- Lookup workflow:\n  1. Check KB cache first (fast, <0.15s)\n  2. If cache miss: Try fuzzy matching\n  3. If still miss: Fetch from Context7 API\n  4. Store in cache for future use\n\n**Supported Test Frameworks:**\n- **pytest**: Python testing framework (primary)\n- **unittest**: Python standard library testing\n- **jest**: JavaScript/TypeScript testing\n- **vitest**: Fast Vite-native testing\n- **mocha**: JavaScript test framework\n\n**Usage:**\n- **Before generating tests**: Lookup test framework docs from Context7 KB cache\n- **Verify patterns**: Ensure test code matches official framework documentation\n- **Check best practices**: Reference cached docs for patterns and examples\n- **Avoid outdated patterns**: Use real, version-specific documentation\n\n**Example Workflow:**\n```python\n# User asks: \"Generate tests for calculator.py\"\n# Tester automatically:\n# 1. Analyzes calculator.py structure\n# 2. Looks up pytest docs from Context7 KB cache\n# 3. Uses cached documentation for correct pytest patterns\n# 4. Generates tests matching official pytest best practices\n```\n\n## Test Quality Standards\n\n- **Coverage**: Target 80%+ coverage\n- **Naming**: Descriptive test names (test_function_name_scenario)\n- **Structure**: Arrange-Act-Assert pattern\n- **Isolation**: Tests should be independent\n- **Mocking**: Mock external dependencies\n- **Documentation**: Include docstrings for complex tests\n\n## Test Framework\n\n**Default: pytest**\n\n- Use pytest fixtures for setup/teardown\n- Use pytest.mark for test categorization\n- Use pytest.parametrize for parameterized tests\n- Use pytest.raises for exception testing\n\n**Context7 Integration:**\n- Lookup pytest documentation from KB cache\n- Use cached docs for fixture patterns\n- Reference parametrization examples\n- Follow official pytest best practices\n\n## Expert System Integration\n\n**Automatic Expert Consultation:**\n- Testers consult relevant domain experts for test strategy and patterns\n- Experts provide domain-specific test scenarios and edge cases\n- Expert knowledge improves test coverage for domain-specific logic\n\n**Discover and consult experts via `@expert` skill or CLI:**\n- `@expert *list` - List all available experts\n- `@expert *consult <domain> \"<question>\"` - Consult a domain expert\n- `@expert *search \"<query>\"` - Search across all knowledge bases\n- `tapps-agents expert list` / `consult` / `search` / `cached` - CLI equivalents\n\n## Configuration\n\n**Test Configuration:**\n- Test framework: pytest (default)\n- Coverage target: 80%+\n- Test directory: `tests/` (default)\n\n**Context7 Configuration:**\n- Location: `.tapps-agents/config.yaml` (context7 section)\n- KB Cache: `.tapps-agents/kb/context7-cache`\n- Auto-refresh: Enabled by default\n\n## Constraints\n\n- **Do not skip error cases** in tests\n- **Do not create tests without assertions**\n- **Do not use outdated test patterns** (always check Context7 KB cache)\n- **Do not ignore coverage** requirements\n- **Always use Context7 KB cache** for test framework documentation\n\n## Integration\n\n- **Context7**: KB-first test framework documentation lookup\n- **pytest**: Primary test framework\n- **Coverage Tools**: Coverage.py integration\n- **Config System**: Loads configuration from `.tapps-agents/config.yaml`\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n1. **Generate Tests**:\n   ```\n   *test calculator.py\n   ```\n\n2. **Context7 Lookup** (automatic):\n   - Detects test framework (pytest)\n   - Looks up pytest docs from KB cache\n   - Uses cached documentation for correct test patterns\n\n3. **Test Generation**:\n   - Analyzes code structure\n   - Generates unit tests using Context7 docs\n   - Creates test file in `tests/` directory\n\n4. **Test Execution**:\n   - Runs pytest on generated tests\n   - Reports coverage\n   - Shows test results\n\n5. **Result**:\n   - Test file created\n   - Tests executed\n   - Coverage reported\n   - Context7 docs referenced (if used)\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use Context7 KB cache** for all test framework documentation\n2. **Target 80%+ coverage** for all code\n3. **Follow Arrange-Act-Assert pattern** for test structure\n4. **Mock external dependencies** appropriately\n5. **Include edge cases** and error handling\n6. **Use descriptive test names** that explain what is being tested\n7. **Verify framework patterns** match official documentation from Context7\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n**Generate and Run Tests:**\n```\n*test calculator.py\n# Automatically looks up pytest docs from Context7 KB cache\n```\n\n**Generate Integration Tests:**\n```\n*test api.py --integration\n```\n\n**Get Test Framework Docs:**\n```\n*docs pytest fixtures\n*docs pytest parametrize\n```\n\n**Generate Tests Only:**\n```\n*generate-tests utils.py\n```\n\n**Run Existing Tests:**\n```\n*run-tests\n*run-tests tests/test_calculator.py\n```\n\n**Refresh Framework Docs:**\n```\n*docs-refresh pytest\n```\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:33.485Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents needing comprehensive test generation and execution capabilities","zh":"适合需要全面测试生成和执行能力的代码审查代理","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが包括的なテスト生成と実行機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"전체적인 테스트 생성 및 실행 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan capacidades integrales de generación y ejecución de pruebas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de revue de code ayant besoin de capacités complètes de génération et d''exécution de tests","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die umfassende Testgenerierungs- und Testausführungsfähigkeiten benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de capacidades de geração e execução de testes abrangentes","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодового обзора, требующих всесторонних возможностей генерации и выполнения тестов","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة الكودية التي تحتاج إلى القدرات الشاملة لإنشاء الاختبار والتشغيل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and run unit and integration tests using pytest, track test coverage, and utilize Context7 KB cache for efficient test framework documentation, following best practices and project test patterns","zh":"使代理能够使用pytest创建和运行单元测试和集成测试，跟踪测试覆盖率，并利用Context7 KB缓存实现高效的测试框架文档，遵循最佳实践和项目测试模式","ja":"pytestを使用して単体テストと統合テストを作成して実行し、テストカバレッジを追跡し、Context7 KBキャッシュを使用してテストフレームワークのドキュメント化を効率化し、ベストプラクティスとプロジェクトのテストパターンに従うことができる","ko":"pytest를 사용하여 단위 테스트와 통합 테스트를 생성하고 실행하고 테스트 커버리지 추적 및 Context7 KB 캐시를 사용하여 테스트 프레임워크 문서화를 효율화하고 최고의實踐 및 プロジェクト 테스트 패턴을 따를 수 있도록 한다","es":"Permite a los agentes crear y ejecutar pruebas unitarias y de integración usando pytest, realizar un seguimiento de la cobertura de pruebas y utilizar la caché de Context7 KB para una documentación eficiente del framework de pruebas, siguiendo las mejores prácticas y los patrones de prueba del proyecto","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et d''exécuter des tests unitaires et d''intégration en utilisant pytest, de suivre la couverture des tests et d''utiliser le cache Context7 KB pour une documentation efficace du framework de tests, en suivant les meilleures pratiques et les modèles de test du projet","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Unit- und Integrationstests mit pytest zu erstellen und auszuführen, die Testabdeckung zu verfolgen und den Context7 KB-Cache für eine effiziente Dokumentation des Testframeworks zu nutzen, unter Beachtung bewährter Verfahren und projektbezogener Testmuster","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e executar testes unitários e de integração usando pytest, rastrear a cobertura de testes e utilizar o cache do Context7 KB para documentação eficiente do framework de teste, seguindo as melhores práticas e padrões de teste do projeto","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и запускать модульные и интеграционные тесты с помощью pytest, отслеживать покрытие тестов и использовать кэш Context7 KB для эффективной документации тестового фреймворка, следуя лучшим практикам и шаблонам тестирования проекта","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء وتشغيل الاختبارات الوحدة والتكامل باستخدام pytest، وتتبع تغطية الاختبار، واستخدام ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت Context7 KB لتوثيق إطار الاختبار الفعال، مع اتباع أفضل الممارسات وأنماط الاختبار للمشروع"},"useC