dings personalizables para la integración con otros servicios de Azure"],"fr":["Déclencheurs HTTP pour l''exécution de code en réponse à des requêtes web","Déclencheurs de minuterie pour l''exécution de code à intervalles réguliers","Déclencheurs de file d''attente pour l''exécution de code en réponse à des messages de file d''attente","Fonctions durables pour la création de flux de travail et d''orchestration","Liaisons personnalisables pour l''intégration avec d''autres services Azure"],"de":["HTTP-Trigger für die Ausführung von Code in Reaktion auf Webanfragen","Timer-Trigger für die Ausführung von Code in regelmäßigen Abständen","Warteschlangen-Trigger für die Ausführung von Code in Reaktion auf Warteschlangennachrichten","Durable Functions für die Erstellung von Workflows und Orchestrierung","Anpassbare Bindungen für die Integration mit anderen Azure-Diensten"],"pt":["Triggers de HTTP, temporizador e fila","Funções duráveis para orquestração","Ligação de funções para melhorar a produtividade","Suporte a linguagens de programação como C#, Python e JavaScript","Integração com outros serviços do Azure","Criptografia e segurança para proteger os dados"],"ru":["Триггеры HTTP, таймера и очереди","Долгосрочные функции для оркестровки","Привязка функций для повышения производительности","Поддержка языков программирования, таких как C#, Python и JavaScript","Интеграция с другими сервисами Azure","Шифрование и безопасность для защиты данных"],"ar":["مؤشرات HTTP، مؤقت وترتيب","دوال مستدامة لتنسيق الأعمال","ربط الوظائف لتحسين الإنتاجية","دعم لغات البرمجة مثل C#، Python و JavaScript","التكامل مع خدمات أخرى من Azure","التشفير والأمان لحماية البيانات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use azure functions","azure functions setup guide","azure functions vs aws lambda","azure functions install","what is azure functions","azure functions alternative","azure functions tutorial","azure functions best practices","azure functions serverless computing"],"zh":["Azure Functions","无服务器计算","事件驱动计算","HTTP 触发器","Durable Functions","函数绑定","Azure Storage","资源组"],"ja":["Azure Functions","サーバーレス コンピューティング","イベント ドリブン コンピューティング","HTTP トリガー","Durable Functions","関数バインド","Azure Storage","リソース グループ","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Azure Functions","서버리스 컴퓨팅","이벤트 드리븐 컴퓨팅","HTTP 트리거","Durable Functions","함수 바인딩","Azure Storage","리소스 그룹","AI 툴"],"es":["Azure Functions","aplicaciones serverless","triggers HTTP","triggers de temporizador","triggers de cola","Durable Functions","bindings personalizables","computación en la nube","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Azure Functions","applications sans serveur","déclencheurs HTTP","déclencheurs de minuterie","déclencheurs de file d''attente","Fonctions durables","liaisons personnalisables","calcul en nuage","développement d''applications"],"de":["Azure Functions","serverlose Anwendungen","HTTP-Trigger","Timer-Trigger","Warteschlangen-Trigger","Durable Functions","anpassbare Bindungen","Cloud-Computing","Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["azure functions","aplicativos serverless","triggers de http","funções duráveis","ligação de funções","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","computação de eventos","serviços do azure","segurança de dados"],"ru":["azure functions","серверные приложения","триггеры http","долгосрочные функции","привязка функций","разработка приложений","событийные вычисления","сервисы azure","безопасность данных"],"ar":["وظيفة azure","تطبيقات بدون خادم","مؤشرات http","دوال مستدامة","ربط الوظائف","تطوير التطبيقات","حساب الأحداث","خدمات azure","أمان البيانات"]}},"owner":"HouseGarofalo","repo":"claude-code-base","repoPath":"HouseGarofalo/claude-code-base","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.313Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-functions","description":"Build serverless applications with Azure Functions. Create HTTP triggers, queue processors, timer functions, and durable orchestrations. Use for event-driven computing, API backends, and serverless microservices on Azure.","bodyPreview":"# Azure Functions Skill\n\nBuild serverless applications with Azure Functions for event-driven computing.\n\n## Triggers\n\nUse this skill when you see:\n- azure functions, function app, serverless azure\n- http trigger, timer trigger, queue trigger\n- durable functions, orchestration\n- function binding, function.json\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Create Function App\n\n```bash\n# Create storage account (required)\naz storage account create \\\n    --name myfuncstorage \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --location e","body":"# Azure Functions Skill\n\nBuild serverless applications with Azure Functions for event-driven computing.\n\n## Triggers\n\nUse this skill when you see:\n- azure functions, function app, serverless azure\n- http trigger, timer trigger, queue trigger\n- durable functions, orchestration\n- function binding, function.json\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Create Function App\n\n```bash\n# Create storage account (required)\naz storage account create \\\n    --name myfuncstorage \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --location eastus \\\n    --sku Standard_LRS\n\n# Create Function App\naz functionapp create \\\n    --name myfuncapp \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --storage-account myfuncstorage \\\n    --consumption-plan-location eastus \\\n    --runtime python \\\n    --runtime-version 3.11 \\\n    --functions-version 4\n\n# Create with Premium plan\naz functionapp plan create \\\n    --name mypremiumplan \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --location eastus \\\n    --sku EP1\n\naz functionapp create \\\n    --name myfuncapp \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --storage-account myfuncstorage \\\n    --plan mypremiumplan \\\n    --runtime node \\\n    --runtime-version 20 \\\n    --functions-version 4\n```\n\n### Python Functions (v2 Programming Model)\n\n#### HTTP Trigger\n\n```python\nimport azure.functions as func\nimport logging\nimport json\n\napp = func.FunctionApp(http_auth_level=func.AuthLevel.FUNCTION)\n\n@app.route(route=\"hello\")\ndef hello_http(req: func.HttpRequest) -> func.HttpResponse:\n    logging.info(''HTTP trigger function processed a request.'')\n\n    name = req.params.get(''name'')\n    if not name:\n        try:\n            req_body = req.get_json()\n            name = req_body.get(''name'')\n        except ValueError:\n            pass\n\n    if name:\n        return func.HttpResponse(f\"Hello, {name}!\")\n    else:\n        return func.HttpResponse(\n            \"Please pass a name on the query string or in the request body\",\n            status_code=400\n        )\n\n@app.route(route=\"users/{id}\", methods=[\"GET\"])\ndef get_user(req: func.HttpRequest) -> func.HttpResponse:\n    user_id = req.route_params.get(''id'')\n    # Fetch user from database\n    return func.HttpResponse(\n        json.dumps({\"id\": user_id, \"name\": \"John\"}),\n        mimetype=\"application/json\"\n    )\n```\n\n#### Timer Trigger\n\n```python\n@app.timer_trigger(schedule=\"0 */5 * * * *\", arg_name=\"timer\")\ndef timer_function(timer: func.TimerRequest) -> None:\n    if timer.past_due:\n        logging.info(''The timer is past due!'')\n\n    logging.info(''Timer trigger function executed.'')\n    # Run scheduled task\n```\n\n#### Queue Trigger\n\n```python\n@app.queue_trigger(arg_name=\"msg\", queue_name=\"myqueue\",\n                   connection=\"AzureWebJobsStorage\")\ndef queue_processor(msg: func.QueueMessage) -> None:\n    logging.info(f''Queue trigger processed: {msg.get_body().decode()}'')\n\n    data = json.loads(msg.get_body().decode())\n    process_message(data)\n\n# Output binding to queue\n@app.route(route=\"enqueue\")\n@app.queue_output(arg_name=\"msg\", queue_name=\"myqueue\",\n                  connection=\"AzureWebJobsStorage\")\ndef enqueue_message(req: func.HttpRequest, msg: func.Out[str]) -> func.HttpResponse:\n    message = req.get_json()\n    msg.set(json.dumps(message))\n    return func.HttpResponse(\"Message enqueued\", status_code=202)\n```\n\n#### Blob Trigger\n\n```python\n@app.blob_trigger(arg_name=\"blob\", path=\"container/{name}\",\n                  connection=\"AzureWebJobsStorage\")\ndef blob_processor(blob: func.InputStream) -> None:\n    logging.info(f''Blob trigger: {blob.name}, Size: {blob.length} bytes'')\n    content = blob.read()\n    process_blob(content)\n\n# Output binding to blob\n@app.route(route=\"upload\")\n@app.blob_output(arg_name=\"outputblob\", path=\"container/{rand-guid}.txt\",\n                 connection=\"AzureWebJobsStorage\")\ndef upload_blob(req: func.HttpRequest, outputblob: func.Out[str]) -> func.HttpResponse:\n    content = req.get_body().decode()\n    outputblob.set(content)\n    return func.HttpResponse(\"Blob created\", status_code=201)\n```\n\n#### Cosmos DB Trigger\n\n```python\n@app.cosmos_db_trigger(arg_name=\"documents\",\n                       container_name=\"items\",\n                       database_name=\"mydb\",\n                       connection=\"CosmosDBConnection\",\n                       lease_container_name=\"leases\",\n                       create_lease_container_if_not_exists=True)\ndef cosmos_trigger(documents: func.DocumentList) -> None:\n    for doc in documents:\n        logging.info(f''Document id: {doc[\"id\"]}'')\n        process_document(doc)\n```\n\n### TypeScript Functions (v4 Programming Model)\n\n```typescript\nimport { app, HttpRequest, HttpResponseInit, InvocationContext } from \"@azure/functions\";\n\n// HTTP trigger\napp.http(\"hello\", {\n  methods: [\"GET\", \"POST\"],\n  authLevel: \"function\",\n  handler: async (request: HttpRequest, context: InvocationContext): Promise<HttpResponseInit> => {\n    context.log(`Http function processed request for url \"${request.url}\"`);\n\n    const name = request.query.get(\"name\") || (await request.text()) || \"world\";\n\n    return {\n      body: `Hello, ${name}!`,\n    };\n  },\n});\n\n// Timer trigger\napp.timer(\"timerTrigger\", {\n  schedule: \"0 */5 * * * *\",\n  handler: async (timer: Timer, context: InvocationContext): Promise<void> => {\n    context.log(\"Timer trigger function executed\");\n  },\n});\n\n// Queue trigger with output binding\napp.storageQueue(\"queueTrigger\", {\n  queueName: \"myqueue\",\n  connection: \"AzureWebJobsStorage\",\n  handler: async (message: unknown, context: InvocationContext): Promise<void> => {\n    context.log(`Queue message: ${JSON.stringify(message)}`);\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Durable Functions\n\n```python\nimport azure.functions as func\nimport azure.durable_functions as df\n\napp = func.FunctionApp(http_auth_level=func.AuthLevel.FUNCTION)\n\n# Orchestrator\n@app.orchestration_trigger(context_name=\"context\")\ndef orchestrator(context: df.DurableOrchestrationContext):\n    # Fan-out/fan-in pattern\n    tasks = []\n    for i in range(5):\n        tasks.append(context.call_activity(\"activity_function\", i))\n\n    results = yield context.task_all(tasks)\n\n    # Process results\n    total = sum(results)\n    return total\n\n# Activity\n@app.activity_trigger(input_name=\"input\")\ndef activity_function(input: int) -> int:\n    return input * 2\n\n# HTTP starter\n@app.route(route=\"orchestrators/{functionName}\")\n@app.durable_client_input(client_name=\"client\")\nasync def http_start(req: func.HttpRequest, client: df.DurableOrchestrationClient) -> func.HttpResponse:\n    function_name = req.route_params.get(''functionName'')\n    instance_id = await client.start_new(function_name)\n\n    return client.create_check_status_response(req, instance_id)\n```\n\n### Application Settings\n\n```bash\n# Set application settings\naz functionapp config appsettings set \\\n    --name myfuncapp \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --settings \"DatabaseConnection=connection-string\" \\\n               \"ApiKey=your-api-key\"\n\n# Get application settings\naz functionapp config appsettings list \\\n    --name myfuncapp \\\n    --resource-group mygroup\n\n# Reference Key Vault secrets\naz functionapp config appsettings set \\\n    --name myfuncapp \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --settings \"Secret=@Microsoft.KeyVault(SecretUri=https://myvault.vault.azure.net/secrets/mysecret/)\"\n```\n\n### Managed Identity\n\n```python\nfrom azure.identity import DefaultAzureCredential\nfrom azure.keyvault.secrets import SecretClient\n\n# Use managed identity\ncredential = DefaultAzureCredential()\nsecret_client = SecretClient(\n    vault_url=\"https://myvault.vault.azure.net\",\n    credential=credential\n)\n\nsecret = secret_client.get_secret(\"my-secret\")\n```\n\n### Deployment\n\n```bash\n# Deploy from local\nfunc azure functionapp publish myfuncapp\n\n# Deploy with zip\naz functionapp deployment source config-zip \\\n    --name myfuncapp \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --src app.zip\n\n# Continuous deployment from GitHub\naz functionapp deployment source config \\\n    --name myfuncapp \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --repo-url https://github.com/org/repo \\\n    --branch main \\\n    --manual-integration\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Cold Starts**: Use Premium plan for latency-sensitive apps\n2. **Bindings**: Use input/output bindings instead of SDK calls when possible\n3. **Secrets**: Use Key Vault references for sensitive settings\n4. **Logging**: Use structured logging with Application Insights\n5. **Scaling**: Configure host.json for optimal scaling\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### API Backend\n1. Create Function App with HTTP triggers\n2. Implement CRUD operations\n3. Add authentication (Azure AD, API keys)\n4. Configure CORS settings\n5. Enable Application Insights\n\n### Event Processing\n1. Set up queue/blob/Cosmos DB triggers\n2. Implement processing logic\n3. Configure dead-letter queues\n4. Add retry policies\n5. Monitor with alerts\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:40.251Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents needing serverless application development with Azure Functions","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Azure Functions 进行无服务器应用程序开发的云代理","ja":"Azure Functions を使用したサーバーレス アプリケーション開発を必要とするクラウド エージェントに最適","ko":"Azure Functions를 사용하여 서버리스 애플리케이션 개발이 필요한 클라우드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes en la nube que necesitan desarrollo de aplicaciones sin servidor con Azure Functions","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud nécessitant un développement d''applications sans serveur avec Azure Functions","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agents, die serverlose Anwendungsentwicklung mit Azure Functions benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Nuvem que necessitam de desenvolvimento de aplicativos sem servidor com Azure Functions","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, которым требуется разработка серверных приложений с помощью Azure Functions","ar":"مثالي لعميل السحابة الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير تطبيقات بدون خادم مع Azure Functions"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build event-driven computing applications using HTTP, timer, and queue triggers, and leverage durable functions for orchestration, all while utilizing Azure''s serverless architecture and function binding capabilities","zh":"赋予代理构建使用 HTTP、定时器和队列触发器的事件驱动计算应用程序的能力，并利用 Azure 的无服务器架构和函数绑定功能进行编排","ja":"HTTP、タイマー、キュー トリガーを使用したイベント ドリブン コンピューティング アプリケーションを構築し、Azure のサーバーレス アーキテクチャと関数バインディング機能を使用してオーケストレーションを行うエージェントの能力を提供する","ko":"HTTP, 타이머, 큐 트리거를 사용한 이벤트 驱动 컴퓨팅 애플리케이션을 구축하고, Azure의 서버리스 아키텍처와 함수 바인딩 기능을 사용하여 오케스트레이션을 수행할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones de computación orientada a eventos utilizando disparadores HTTP, temporizador y cola, y aprovechar funciones duraderas para la orquestación, todo mientras utiliza la arquitectura sin servidor de Azure y las capacidades de enlace de funciones","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications de calcul déclenchées par des événements en utilisant des déclencheurs HTTP, minuterie et file d''attente, et en exploitant des fonctions durables pour l''orchestration, le tout en utilisant l''architecture sans serveur d''Azure et les capacités de liaison de fonctions","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, ereignisgesteuerte Computing-Anwendungen zu erstellen, die HTTP-, Timer- und Warteschlangen-Trigger verwenden, und nutzt dabei durable Funktionen für die Orchestrierung, während die serverlose Architektur und die Funktionsbindungsfähigkeiten von Azure genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações de computação orientada a eventos usando HTTP, temporizadores e gatilhos de fila, e aproveitar funções duráveis para orquestração, tudo isso utilizando a arquitetura sem servidor do Azure e as capacidades de ligação de funções","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать приложения, основанные на событиях, используя HTTP, таймеры и триггеры очереди, и использовать прочные функции для оркестровки, все это при использовании бессерверной архитектуры Azure и возможностей привязки функций","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات الحوسبة الموجهة بالأحداث باستخدام HTTP و المؤقتات و معالجات الطوابير، وتفويض الوظائف المتماسكة للترتيب، وكل ذلك مع استخدام هندسة خادم Azure بدون خادم وقدرات ربط الوظائف"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating workflows with Azure Function triggers","Building serverless APIs with HTTP triggers","Debugging and optimizing Azure Function performance"],"zh":["使用 Azure Function 触发器自动化工作流程","使用 HTTP 触发器构建无服务器 API","调试和优化 Azure Function 性能"],"ja":["Azure Function トリガーを使用したワークフローの自動化","HTTP トリガーを使用したサーバーレス API の構築","Azure Function のパフォーマンスのデバッグと最適化"],"ko":["Azure Function 트리거를 사용한 워크플로 자동화","HTTP 트리거를 사용한 서버리스 API 구축","Azure Function 성능 디버깅 및 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo con disparadores de Azure Function","Crear APIs sin servidor con disparadores HTTP","Depurar y optimizar el rendimiento de Azure Function"],"fr":["Automatiser les workflows avec des déclencheurs de fonction Azure","Créer des API sans serveur avec des déclencheurs HTTP","Déboguer et optimiser les performances de la fonction Azure"],"de":["Automatisieren von Workflows mit Azure-Funktion-Trigger","Erstellen von serverlosen APIs mit HTTP-Trigger","Debuggen und Optimieren der Leistung von Azure-Funktion"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho com gatilhos do Azure Function","Construir APIs sem servidor com gatilhos HTTP","Depurar e otimizar o desempenho do Azure Function"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих процессов с помощью триггеров Azure Function","Создание серверных API с помощью триггеров HTTP","Отладка и оптимизация производительности Azure Function"],"ar":["أتمتة سير العمل مع معالجات Azure Function","بناء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات بدون خادم مع معالجات HTTP","تصحيح الأخطاء وتحسين أداء Azure Function"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure subscription and storage account","Limited to Azure Functions ecosystem","Dependent on Azure resource group and location"],"zh":["需要 Azure 订阅和存储帐户","仅限 Azure Functions 生态系统","依赖于 Azure 资源组和位置"],"ja":["Azure サブスクリプションとストレージ アカウントが必要","Azure Functions エコシステムのみ","Azure リソース グループと場所に依存"],"ko":["Azure 구독 및 저장소 계정이 필요","Azure Functions 에코시스템만 해당","Azure 리소스 그룹 및 위치에 종속"],"es":["Requiere suscripción de Azure y cuenta de almacenamiento","Limitado al ecosistema de Azure Functions","Dependiente del grupo de recursos de Azure y la ubicación"],"fr":["Nécessite un abonnement Azure et un compte de stockage","Limité à l''écosystème des fonctions Azure","Dépendant du groupe de ressources Azure et de l''emplacement"],"de":["Erfordert Azure-Abonnement und Speicherkonto","Begrenzt auf das Azure Functions-Ökosystem","Abhängig von der Azure-Ressourcengruppe und -Speicherort"],"pt":["Exige assinatura do Azure e conta de armazenamento","Limitado ao ecossistema do Azure Functions","Dependente do grupo de recursos do Azure e localização"],"ru":["Требует подписки Azure и учетной записи хранения","Ограничен экосистемой Azure Functions","Зависит от группы ресурсов Azure и местоположения"],"ar":["يتطلب اشتراكًا في Azure وحساب تخزين","محدود بنظام Azure Functions البيئي","يعتمد على مجموعة مورد Azure والموقع"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"958aa85bc40106add82dfd4eeb5366d9846eaeea46c290991de79080b11a2a38","qualityScore":60}');
