测试套件生成","覆盖率分析","端到端测试","Python 脚本","CLI 接口","AI エージェント"],"ja":["Senior Qa","自動テスト","テストスイートの自動生成","カバレッジ分析","E2E テスト","Python スクリプト","CLI インターフェース","AI エージェント"],"ko":["Senior Qa","자동화된 테스트","테스트 스위트 생성","커버리지 분석","E2E 테스트","Python 스크립트","CLI 인터페이스","AI 에이전트"],"es":["Senior QA","herramientas de automatización","scripts de Python","generación de suites de pruebas","análisis de cobertura","pruebas de extremo a extremo","desarrollo de software","pruebas de software","automatización de pruebas"],"fr":["Senior QA","outils d''automatisation","scripts Python","génération de suites de tests","analyse de la couverture","tests de bout en bout","développement de logiciels","tests de logiciels","automatisation des tests"],"de":["Senior QA","Automatisierungstools","Python-Skripte","Generierung von Test-Suiten","Analyse von Abdeckung","End-to-End-Tests","Softwareentwicklung","Softwaretests","Automatisierung von Tests"],"pt":["Senior QA","testes automatizados","ferramentas de teste","scripts Python","gerador de conjunto de testes","analisador de cobertura","estruturador de testes de ponta a ponta","melhores práticas para testes de software","desenvolvimento de software","qa automation"],"ru":["Senior QA","автоматизированное тестирование","инструменты для тестирования","скрипты Python","генератор набора тестов","анализатор покрытия","создатель тестов от начала до конца","лучшие практики для тестирования программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматизация qa"],"ar":["المسؤول القuido Senior QA","الاختبار الآلي","أدوات الاختبار","سكريبتات Python","مولد مجموعة الاختبار","محلل التغطية","مخطط اختبار من النهاية إلى النهاية","أفضل الممارسات لاختبار البرمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","آليّة qa"]}},"owner":"LRYuChi","repo":"TAHZAN-ARCHIVE","repoPath":"LRYuChi/TAHZAN-ARCHIVE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.314Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"senior-qa","description":"Comprehensive QA and testing skill for quality assurance, test automation, and testing strategies for ReactJS, NextJS, NodeJS applications. Includes test suite generation, coverage analysis, E2E testing setup, and quality metrics. Use when designing test strategies, writing test cases, implementing test automation, performing manual testing, or analyzing test coverage.","bodyPreview":"# Senior Qa\r\n\r\nComplete toolkit for senior qa with modern tools and best practices.\r\n\r\n## Quick Start\r\n\r\n### Main Capabilities\r\n\r\nThis skill provides three core capabilities through automated scripts:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Script 1: Test Suite Generator\r\npython scripts/test_suite_generator.py [options]\r\n\r\n# Script 2: Coverage Analyzer\r\npython scripts/coverage_analyzer.py [options]\r\n\r\n# Script 3: E2E Test Scaffolder\r\npython scripts/e2e_test_scaffolder.py [options]\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Core Capabilities\r\n\r\n### 1. T","body":"# Senior Qa\r\n\r\nComplete toolkit for senior qa with modern tools and best practices.\r\n\r\n## Quick Start\r\n\r\n### Main Capabilities\r\n\r\nThis skill provides three core capabilities through automated scripts:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Script 1: Test Suite Generator\r\npython scripts/test_suite_generator.py [options]\r\n\r\n# Script 2: Coverage Analyzer\r\npython scripts/coverage_analyzer.py [options]\r\n\r\n# Script 3: E2E Test Scaffolder\r\npython scripts/e2e_test_scaffolder.py [options]\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Core Capabilities\r\n\r\n### 1. Test Suite Generator\r\n\r\nAutomated tool for test suite generator tasks.\r\n\r\n**Features:**\r\n- Automated scaffolding\r\n- Best practices built-in\r\n- Configurable templates\r\n- Quality checks\r\n\r\n**Usage:**\r\n```bash\r\npython scripts/test_suite_generator.py <project-path> [options]\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 2. Coverage Analyzer\r\n\r\nComprehensive analysis and optimization tool.\r\n\r\n**Features:**\r\n- Deep analysis\r\n- Performance metrics\r\n- Recommendations\r\n- Automated fixes\r\n\r\n**Usage:**\r\n```bash\r\npython scripts/coverage_analyzer.py <target-path> [--verbose]\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 3. E2E Test Scaffolder\r\n\r\nAdvanced tooling for specialized tasks.\r\n\r\n**Features:**\r\n- Expert-level automation\r\n- Custom configurations\r\n- Integration ready\r\n- Production-grade output\r\n\r\n**Usage:**\r\n```bash\r\npython scripts/e2e_test_scaffolder.py [arguments] [options]\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Reference Documentation\r\n\r\n### Testing Strategies\r\n\r\nComprehensive guide available in `references/testing_strategies.md`:\r\n\r\n- Detailed patterns and practices\r\n- Code examples\r\n- Best practices\r\n- Anti-patterns to avoid\r\n- Real-world scenarios\r\n\r\n### Test Automation Patterns\r\n\r\nComplete workflow documentation in `references/test_automation_patterns.md`:\r\n\r\n- Step-by-step processes\r\n- Optimization strategies\r\n- Tool integrations\r\n- Performance tuning\r\n- Troubleshooting guide\r\n\r\n### Qa Best Practices\r\n\r\nTechnical reference guide in `references/qa_best_practices.md`:\r\n\r\n- Technology stack details\r\n- Configuration examples\r\n- Integration patterns\r\n- Security considerations\r\n- Scalability guidelines\r\n\r\n## Tech Stack\r\n\r\n**Languages:** TypeScript, JavaScript, Python, Go, Swift, Kotlin\r\n**Frontend:** React, Next.js, React Native, Flutter\r\n**Backend:** Node.js, Express, GraphQL, REST APIs\r\n**Database:** PostgreSQL, Prisma, NeonDB, Supabase\r\n**DevOps:** Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform, GitHub Actions, CircleCI\r\n**Cloud:** AWS, GCP, Azure\r\n\r\n## Development Workflow\r\n\r\n### 1. Setup and Configuration\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Install dependencies\r\nnpm install\r\n# or\r\npip install -r requirements.txt\r\n\r\n# Configure environment\r\ncp .env.example .env\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 2. Run Quality Checks\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Use the analyzer script\r\npython scripts/coverage_analyzer.py .\r\n\r\n# Review recommendations\r\n# Apply fixes\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 3. Implement Best Practices\r\n\r\nFollow the patterns and practices documented in:\r\n- `references/testing_strategies.md`\r\n- `references/test_automation_patterns.md`\r\n- `references/qa_best_practices.md`\r\n\r\n## Best Practices Summary\r\n\r\n### Code Quality\r\n- Follow established patterns\r\n- Write comprehensive tests\r\n- Document decisions\r\n- Review regularly\r\n\r\n### Performance\r\n- Measure before optimizing\r\n- Use appropriate caching\r\n- Optimize critical paths\r\n- Monitor in production\r\n\r\n### Security\r\n- Validate all inputs\r\n- Use parameterized queries\r\n- Implement proper authentication\r\n- Keep dependencies updated\r\n\r\n### Maintainability\r\n- Write clear code\r\n- Use consistent naming\r\n- Add helpful comments\r\n- Keep it simple\r\n\r\n## Common Commands\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Development\r\nnpm run dev\r\nnpm run build\r\nnpm run test\r\nnpm run lint\r\n\r\n# Analysis\r\npython scripts/coverage_analyzer.py .\r\npython scripts/e2e_test_scaffolder.py --analyze\r\n\r\n# Deployment\r\ndocker build -t app:latest .\r\ndocker-compose up -d\r\nkubectl apply -f k8s/\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Troubleshooting\r\n\r\n### Common Issues\r\n\r\nCheck the comprehensive troubleshooting section in `references/qa_best_practices.md`.\r\n\r\n### Getting Help\r\n\r\n- Review reference documentation\r\n- Check script output messages\r\n- Consult tech stack documentation\r\n- Review error logs\r\n\r\n## Resources\r\n\r\n- Pattern Reference: `references/testing_strategies.md`\r\n- Workflow Guide: `references/test_automation_patterns.md`\r\n- Technical Guide: `references/qa_best_practices.md`\r\n- Tool Scripts: `scripts/` directory\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:43.872Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Testing Agents needing automated test suite generation and coverage analysis.","zh":"适合需要自动化测试套件生成和覆盖率分析的测试代理。","ja":"自動テストスイート生成とカバレッジ分析が必要なテストエージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 테스트 스위트 생성 및 커버리지 분석이 필요한 테스트 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de prueba que necesitan generación automática de suites de prueba y análisis de cobertura.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de test nécessitant une génération automatique de suites de test et une analyse de couverture.","de":"Perfekt für Testagenten, die eine automatisierte Generierung von Test-Suiten und eine Abdeckungsanalyse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Teste que necessitam de geração automática de suíte de testes e análise de cobertura.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов тестирования, которым требуется автоматическая генерация набора тестов и анализ покрытия.","ar":"مثالي لعميل اختبار يحتاج إلى إنشاء مجموعة اختبار-automatic وتحليل تغطية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline testing workflows with automated scripts for test suite generation, coverage analysis, and E2E test scaffolding using Python scripts and best practices.","zh":"赋予代理人使用Python脚本和最佳实践来简化测试工作流的能力，包括自动化测试套件生成、覆盖率分析和E2E测试脚手架。","ja":"Pythonスクリプトとベストプラクティスを使用して、自動テストスイート生成、カバレッジ分析、およびE2Eテストスキャフォールディングを使用したテストワークフローの簡素化をエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"Python 스크립트와 최선의 관행을 사용하여 자동화된 테스트 스위트 생성, 커버리지 분석 및 E2E 테스트 스캐폴딩을 사용한 테스트 워크플로우를 간소화하는 에이전트를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar los flujos de trabajo de prueba con scripts automatizados para la generación de suites de prueba, análisis de cobertura y estructuración de pruebas E2E utilizando scripts de Python y las mejores prácticas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser les flux de travail de test avec des scripts automatisés pour la génération de suites de test, l''analyse de couverture et la structuration de tests E2E à l''aide de scripts Python et de bonnes pratiques.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Test-Workflows mit automatisierten Skripten für die Generierung von Test-Suiten, Abdeckungsanalyse und E2E-Test-Scaffolding unter Verwendung von Python-Skripten und Best-Practices zu optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar os fluxos de trabalho de teste com scripts automatizados para geração de suíte de testes, análise de cobertura e estruturação de testes E2E usando scripts Python e melhores práticas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать рабочие процессы тестирования с помощью автоматизированных скриптов для генерации набора тестов, анализа покрытия и создания каркаса тестов E2E с использованием скриптов Python и передовой практики.","ar":"يمكن للعميل من خلاله تعزيز تدفقات العمل لاختبار باستخدام البرامج النصية الآلية لتوليد مجموعة اختبار وتحليل التغطية وهيكلة اختبار E2E باستخدام نصوص Python وأفضل الممارسات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating test suite generation for complex applications","Analyzing code coverage for optimization","Scaffolding E2E tests for rapid deployment"],"zh":["复杂应用程序的自动化测试套件生成","优化的代码覆盖率分析","快速部署的E2E测试脚手架"],"ja":["複雑なアプリケーションの自動テストスイート生成","最適化のためのコードカバレッジ分析","迅速なデプロイのためのE2Eテストスキャフォールディング"],"ko":["복잡한 애플리케이션의 자동화된 테스트 스위트 생성","최적화를 위한 코드 커버리지 분석","신속한 배포를 위한 E2E 테스트 스캐폴딩"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de suites de prueba para aplicaciones complejas","Analizar la cobertura de código para la optimización","Estructurar pruebas E2E para una implementación rápida"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération de suites de test pour des applications complexes","Analyser la couverture de code pour l''optimisation","Structurer des tests E2E pour un déploiement rapide"],"de":["Automatisieren der Generierung von Test-Suiten für komplexe Anwendungen","Analysieren der Code-Abdeckung für die Optimierung","Scaffolding von E2E-Tests für einen schnellen Einsatz"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de suíte de testes para aplicações complexas","Analisar a cobertura de código para otimização","Estruturar testes E2E para implantação rápida"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию набора тестов для сложных приложений","Анализировать покрытие кода для оптимизации","Создавать каркас тестов E2E для быстрого развертывания"],"ar":["آليّة إنشاء مجموعة اختبار لبرامج معقدة","تحليل تغطية الكود لتحسين الأداء","بناء هيكل اختبار E2E لتنفيذ سريع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to E2E test scaffolding capabilities"],"zh":["需要Python环境","仅限E2E测试脚手架功能"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","E2Eテストスキャフォールディング機能のみ"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요합니다.","E2E 테스트 스캐폴딩 기능만 제한"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Limitado a capacidades de estructuración de pruebas E2E"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité aux capacités de structuration de tests E2E"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf E2E-Test-Scaffolding-Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Limitado às capacidades de estruturação de testes E2E"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Ограничен возможностями создания каркаса тестов E2E"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","محدود بإمكانيات هيكلة اختبار E2E"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"56333175357e063431866673bd24df8b84638d9239ae32c31469468d5fa65bd6","qualityScore":60}');
