INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('deepdexfinance/deepdex-cli/deepdex-cli', 'deepdex-cli', 'deepdexfinance', 'deepdex-cli', 'community', 'deepdex-cli deepdexfinance deepdex-cli community The deepdex-cli skill enables developers to work with a feature-rich trading bot for spot and perpetual trading on the DeepDex protocol. It benefits developers and traders looking for advanced trading capabilities. DeepDex CLI 是一个高性能的 TypeScript/Bun 应用，用于在 DeepDex 协议上进行交易。它支持 Spot 和 Perpetual 交易，先进订单和子账户管理 DeepDex CLI は高性能の TypeScript/Bun アプリケーションで、DeepDex プロトコル上での取引を実行します。スポット・パーペチュアル取引、先進注文、サブアカウント管理に対応 DeepDex CLI는 높은 성능의 TypeScript/Bun 애플리케이션으로 DeepDex 프로토콜에서 거래를 수행하는 데 사용됩니다. 스폿 및 퍼펫츄얼 거래, 고급 주문, 서브 계정 관리를 지원합니다 Deepdex-cli es un bot de trading de alto rendimiento para operar en el protocolo DeepDex con TypeScript y Bun Deepdex-cli est un bot de trading haute performance pour trader sur le protocole DeepDex avec TypeScript et Bun Deepdex-cli ist ein Hochleistungs-Handelsbot für das Handeln auf dem DeepDex-Protokoll mit TypeScript und Bun O DeepDex CLI é uma ferramenta de trading de alto desempenho em TypeScript/Bun para protocolo DeepDex, com recursos como trading spot e perpetual DeepDex CLI - это высокопроизводительная торговая бот на TypeScript/Bun для протокола DeepDex, с функциями как спотовая и перпетуальная торговля DeepDex CLI هو أداة تداول عالية الأداء بلغة TypeScript/Bun لبروتوكول DeepDex، مع ميزات مثل التداول النقدي والمدى how to use deepdex-cli deepdex-cli setup guide deepdex-cli alternative deepdex-cli vs trading bots deepdex-cli install what is deepdex-cli deepdex-cli trading bot deepdex-cli TypeScript example deepdex-cli Bun application DeepDex CLI 交易机器人 Spot 交易 Perpetual 交易 先进订单 子账户管理 TypeScript Bun 命令行界面 Spot and perpetual trading with limit/market orders and up to 50x leverage Advanced orders including take-profit, stop-loss, post-only, and reduce-only orders Subaccount management for isolated accounts and different strategies Support for ETH/USDC and SOL/USDC trading pairs Automa functionality for automated trading strategies deepdex-cli is a TypeScript/Bun application providing a comprehensive trading bot for the DeepDex protocol with features like spot and perpetual trading, advanced orders, and subaccount management.');
