omático via GitHub Actions e manual local","Verificação manual em cada etapa do processo de lançamento","Criação de tags de lançamento e gatilho de workflows de lançamento","Bump de versão do pacote e preparação para lançamento","Integração com o GitHub Actions para automação de lançamento"],"ru":["Поддержка двух путей выпуска: автоматический через GitHub Actions и ручной локальный","Ручная проверка на каждом этапе процесса выпуска","Создание тегов выпуска и триггер рабочих процессов выпуска","Обновление версии пакета и подготовка к выпуску","Интеграция с GitHub Actions для автоматизации выпуска"],"ar":["دعم مسارات إصدار متعددة: تلقائي عبر الإجراءات الجيت هاب ويدوي محلي","التحقق اليدوي في كل خطوة من عملية الإصدار","إنشاء علامات الإصدار و.trigger سير عمل الإصدار","تحديث إصدار الحزمة والتحضير للإصدار","التكامل مع الإجراءات الجيت هاب لتحكم في الإصدار"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use hex-release","hex-release setup guide","automated package release","hex-release alternative","hex-release vs manual release","github actions for hex-release","hex-release install","what is hex-release"],"zh":["Hex Release","AIエージェント工具","自动化发布","手动发布","GitHub Actions","Hex 包发布","交互式工作流程"],"ja":["Hex Release","AIエージェント","自動化发布","手動发布","GitHub Actions","Hex パッケージ公開","インタラクティブなワークフロー"],"ko":["Hex Release","AI 에이전트","자동화 발행","수동 발행","GitHub Actions","Hex 패키지 발행","인터랙티브 워크플로우"],"es":["hex-release","agentes de Inteligencia Artificial","lanzamiento de paquetes","automatización de lanzamiento","verificación manual","GitHub Actions","etiquetas de lanzamiento","flujos de trabajo de lanzamiento"],"fr":["hex-release","outils d''Intelligence Artificielle","publication de packages","automatisation de publication","vérification manuelle","GitHub Actions","étiquettes de publication","flux de travail de publication"],"de":["hex-release","KI-Agents","Veröffentlichung von Paketen","Automatisierung der Veröffentlichung","manuelle Überprüfung","GitHub Actions","Veröffentlichungsetiketten","Veröffentlichungsworkflows"],"pt":["Hex Release","automação de lançamento de pacotes","verificação manual","GitHub Actions","lançamento de software","gerenciamento de versão","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","automatização de processos"],"ru":["Hex Release","автоматизация выпуска пакетов","ручная проверка","GitHub Actions","выпуск программного обеспечения","управление версиями","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","автоматизация процессов"],"ar":["Hex Release","أداة تحكم في إصدارات الحزم","التحقق اليدوي","الإجراءات الجيت هاب","إصدار البرمجيات","إدارة الإصدارات","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","تحكم في العمليات"]}},"owner":"agentjido","repo":"jido_signal","repoPath":"agentjido/jido_signal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.326Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"hex-release","description":"Guides interactive Hex package release for AgentJido repos. Supports automated (GitHub Actions workflow_dispatch) and manual release flows. Uses git_ops for version bumping and changelog generation. Triggers on: release, hex publish, bump version, new release, publish package.","bodyPreview":"# Hex Release (Human-in-the-Loop)\n\nInteractive workflow for releasing a Hex package with manual verification at each step.\nSupports two release paths: **automated** (via GitHub Actions) and **manual** (local).\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when asked to:\n- Release a new version to Hex\n- Bump the package version\n- Prepare a release\n- Create a release tag\n- Trigger a release workflow\n\n## Pre-flight Checks\n\nBefore starting, run these checks automatically:\n\n### 1. Identify the Package\n\nRead `mix.e","body":"# Hex Release (Human-in-the-Loop)\n\nInteractive workflow for releasing a Hex package with manual verification at each step.\nSupports two release paths: **automated** (via GitHub Actions) and **manual** (local).\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when asked to:\n- Release a new version to Hex\n- Bump the package version\n- Prepare a release\n- Create a release tag\n- Trigger a release workflow\n\n## Pre-flight Checks\n\nBefore starting, run these checks automatically:\n\n### 1. Identify the Package\n\nRead `mix.exs` to determine:\n- Package name (from `project()` → `:name` or `:app`)\n- Current version (from `@version` or `project()` → `:version`)\n- Whether it has `git_ops` as a dependency (required for automated release)\n\n### 2. Check for Git Dependencies\n\n```bash\ngrep -E ''github:|git:|path:'' mix.exs\n```\n\nCategorize any git/path deps found:\n- **dev/test only** (`only: [:dev, :test]`): Will not block Hex publish — note but continue\n- **runtime deps**: **STOP** — these block `mix hex.publish`. Tell the user which deps need to be published to Hex first or switched to Hex versions\n\n### 3. Git Status\n\n```bash\ngit status --porcelain\n```\nIf dirty, **STOP** and ask user to commit or stash changes first.\n\n### 4. Verify Branch\n\n```bash\ngit branch --show-current\n```\nConfirm user is on `main`. Warn if on a different branch.\n\n### 5. Check for Releasable Commits\n\n```bash\ngit log --oneline $(git describe --tags --abbrev=0 2>/dev/null || echo \"\")..HEAD\n```\nIf no commits since last tag, **STOP** — nothing to release.\n\nReview commits and confirm they follow conventional commit format (`feat:`, `fix:`, `chore:`, etc.).\nNon-conventional commits won''t be picked up by `git_ops` for the CHANGELOG.\n\n### 6. Run Tests\n\n```bash\nmix test\n```\nIf tests fail, **STOP** and show failures.\n\n### 7. Run Quality Checks\n\n```bash\nmix quality\n```\nThis typically runs: format check, compile with warnings-as-errors, credo, and dialyzer.\nIf the alias doesn''t exist, run `mix format --check-formatted && mix compile --warnings-as-errors` as a minimum.\nIf any check fails, **STOP** and show the issues.\n\n### 8. Hex Publish Dry Run\n\n```bash\nmix hex.publish --dry-run\n```\nVerify the package metadata and file list look correct. If this fails, **STOP**.\n\n**SHOW USER**: Summary of all pre-flight results and current version.\n\n**ASK USER**: \"All checks passed. Which release path: **automated** (GitHub Actions) or **manual** (local)?\"\n\n---\n\n## Path A: Automated Release (GitHub Actions)\n\nThe AgentJido repos have a reusable release workflow triggered via `workflow_dispatch`.\n\n### Step 1: Confirm Workflow Exists\n\nCheck that `.github/workflows/release.yml` exists and calls:\n```yaml\nuses: agentjido/github-actions/.github/workflows/elixir-release.yml@main\n```\n\n### Step 2: Explain Dispatch Options\n\n**TELL USER**:\n```\nThe release workflow supports these options:\n\n  • dry_run: true     — Full dry run (no git push, no tag, no Hex publish)\n  • hex_dry_run: true — Runs git_ops release + push, but skips actual Hex publish\n  • skip_tests: true  — Skip test step (use if CI already passed)\n\nRecommended first run: dry_run: true\n```\n\n### Step 3: Trigger the Workflow\n\n**Option 1 — GitHub CLI** (if `gh` is available):\n```bash\n# Dry run first\ngh workflow run release.yml -f dry_run=true\n\n# Watch the run\ngh run list --workflow=release.yml --limit=1\ngh run watch\n```\n\n**Option 2 — GitHub UI**:\n```\n1. Go to: https://github.com/agentjido/{REPO}/actions/workflows/release.yml\n2. Click \"Run workflow\"\n3. Set dry_run = true for first attempt\n4. Click \"Run workflow\"\n```\n\n**ASK USER**: \"Run a dry run first? (recommended)\"\n\n### Step 4: Verify Dry Run Results\n\nAfter the dry run completes:\n```bash\ngh run view --log-failed  # Check for errors\n```\n\nReview the workflow summary for:\n- Version that would be released\n- Hex publish dry-run output\n- Any skipped steps\n\n**ASK USER**: \"Dry run succeeded. Ready to run the real release?\"\n\n### Step 5: Trigger Real Release\n\n```bash\ngh workflow run release.yml\n# Or with skip_tests if CI already passed:\ngh workflow run release.yml -f skip_tests=true\n```\n\n### Step 6: Verify\n\n```bash\ngh run watch  # Wait for completion\n```\n\n**TELL USER**:\n```\n✅ Release triggered!\n\nThe workflow will:\n  1. Run git_ops.release to bump version + update CHANGELOG\n  2. Push the release commit and tag\n  3. Publish to Hex.pm\n  4. Create a GitHub Release\n\nMonitor at: https://github.com/agentjido/{REPO}/actions\nAfter publish, verify at: https://hex.pm/packages/{PACKAGE}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Path B: Manual Release (Local)\n\nUse when the automated workflow isn''t available, or for repos that can''t publish to Hex (e.g., git deps blocking publish).\n\n### Step 1: Determine Version Bump\n\n`git_ops` handles this automatically from conventional commits, but ask the user for confirmation.\n\nRun the release in dry-run mode to preview:\n```bash\nmix git_ops.release --dry-run\n```\n\nThis shows what version would be bumped to based on commit types:\n- `feat:` commits → minor bump\n- `fix:` commits → patch bump\n- `BREAKING CHANGE:` → major bump\n\n**SHOW USER**: The proposed version bump and commits that will be included.\n\n**ASK USER**: \"git_ops wants to release vX.Y.Z. Proceed, or override with a specific version?\"\n\n### Step 2: Run the Release\n\n```bash\n# Let git_ops decide the version:\nmix git_ops.release --yes\n\n# Or force a specific version:\nmix git_ops.release --yes --new-version X.Y.Z\n```\n\nThis will:\n- Bump the version in `mix.exs`\n- Update `CHANGELOG.md` from conventional commits\n- Create a release commit\n- Create a git tag\n\n**SHOW USER**: The release commit diff and tag.\n\n### Step 3: Review Before Pushing\n\n```bash\ngit log --oneline -3\ngit diff HEAD~1\ngit tag -l | tail -5\n```\n\n**ASK USER**: \"Release commit and tag created locally. Ready to push?\"\n\n### Step 4: Push\n\n```bash\ngit push origin main\ngit push origin --tags\n```\n\n### Step 5: Publish to Hex\n\n```bash\n# Final dry-run check\nmix hex.publish --dry-run\n\n# Publish\nmix hex.publish --yes\n```\n\n### Step 6: Create GitHub Release\n\n```bash\nVERSION=\"v$(grep -m1 ''@version \"'' mix.exs | sed ''s/.*\"\\(.*\\)\".*/\\1/'')\"\ngh release create \"$VERSION\" \\\n  --title \"Release $VERSION\" \\\n  --notes \"See [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md) for details.\"\n```\n\n**TELL USER**:\n```\n✅ Release complete!\n\n  Published: https://hex.pm/packages/{PACKAGE}\n  GitHub:    https://github.com/agentjido/{REPO}/releases/tag/{VERSION}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Rollback\n\n### Before pushing:\n```bash\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1          # Undo release commit\ngit tag -d v{VERSION}            # Delete local tag\ngit checkout mix.exs CHANGELOG.md  # Restore files\n```\n\n### After pushing but before Hex publish:\n```bash\ngit push origin :refs/tags/v{VERSION}  # Delete remote tag\ngit revert HEAD                         # Revert release commit\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n### After Hex publish:\nHex packages **cannot be unpublished** after 1 hour. You can retire a version:\n```bash\nmix hex.retire {PACKAGE} {VERSION} invalid --message \"Released in error\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- All AgentJido repos use **conventional commits** — non-conventional commits are ignored by `git_ops`\n- The `quality` mix alias varies per repo — check `mix.exs` aliases section\n- `git_ops` is a dev-only dependency — release commands run in `MIX_ENV=dev`\n- The automated workflow uses `GITHUB_TOKEN` for git push and `HEX_API_KEY` (org secret) for Hex publish\n- Repos with runtime git dependencies (e.g., `jido_runic`) cannot publish to Hex — use manual path for git tag/release only, skip Hex publish step\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:01.987Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Elixir Agents managing package versions and requiring automated Hex package releases with manual verification.","zh":"适用于管理包版本并需要自动 Hex 包发布和手动验证的 Elixir 代理。","ja":"パッケージのバージョンを管理し、自動的な Hex パッケージのリリースと手動での検証が必要な Elixir エージェントに適しています。","ko":"패키지 버전을 관리하며 자동 Hex 패키지 릴리스와 수동 확인이 필요한 Elixir 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Elixir que gestionan versiones de paquetes y requieren lanzamientos de paquetes Hex automatizados con verificación manual.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Elixir qui gèrent les versions de packages et nécessitent des publications de packages Hex automatisées avec vérification manuelle.","de":"Ideal für Elixir-Agents, die Paketversionen verwalten und automatisierte Hex-Paket-Veröffentlichungen mit manueller Überprüfung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Elixir que gerenciam versões de pacotes e exigem lançamentos de pacotes Hex automatizados com verificação manual.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Elixir, управляющих версиями пакетов и требующих автоматических релизов пакетов Hex с ручной верификацией.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إليكسر الذي يدير إصدارات الحزم ويتطلب إصدارات حزم هكس أوتوماتيكية مع التحقق اليدوي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to release new Hex package versions with automated and manual release paths, supporting GitHub Actions and local workflows, while performing pre-flight checks like identifying the package and reading mix.exs files.","zh":"赋予代理发布新 Hex 包版本的能力，支持自动和手动发布路径，包括 GitHub Actions 和本地工作流，同时执行预检，如识别包和读取 mix.exs 文件。","ja":"新しい Hex パッケージのバージョンをリリースするエージェントの能力を与え、自動および手動のリリースパスをサポートし、GitHub Actions およびローカルワークフローを使用しながら、パッケージの識別や mix.exs ファイルの読み取りなどの事前チェックを実行します。","ko":"新的 Hex 패키지 버전을 릴리스할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, 자동 및 수동 릴리스 경로를 지원하고, GitHub Actions 및 로컬 워크플로우를 사용하면서 패키지 식별 및 mix.exs 파일 읽기와 같은 사전 체크를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a publicar nuevas versiones de paquetes Hex con rutas de lanzamiento automático y manual, que admiten GitHub Actions y flujos de trabajo locales, mientras realizan comprobaciones previas al vuelo como la identificación del paquete y la lectura de archivos mix.exs.","fr":"Permet aux agents de publier de nouvelles versions de packages Hex avec des chemins de publication automatisés et manuels, prenant en charge les GitHub Actions et les flux de travail locaux, tout en effectuant des vérifications préalables comme l''identification du package et la lecture des fichiers mix.exs.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, neue Versionen von Hex-Paketen mit automatisierten und manuellen Veröffentlichungspfaden zu veröffentlichen, die GitHub Actions und lokale Workflows unterstützen, während sie vor dem Veröffentlichungsprozess Prüfungen wie die Identifizierung des Pakets und das Lesen von mix.exs-Dateien durchführen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lançar novas versões de pacotes Hex com caminhos de lançamento automatizados e manuais, suportando GitHub Actions e fluxos de trabalho locais, ao mesmo tempo em que executa verificações pré-voo, como identificar o pacote e ler arquivos mix.exs.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выпускать новые версии пакетов Hex с автоматизированными и ручными путями выпуска, поддерживая GitHub Actions и локальные рабочие процессы, а также выполняя предварительные проверки, такие как идентификация пакета и чтение файлов mix.exs.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إصدار إصدارات جديدة من حزم هكس باستخدام مسارات إصدار أوتوماتيكية ويدوية، ودعم إجراءات جيثب وأعمال التطوير المحلية، وفي الوقت نفسه يقوم بعمليات التحقق المسبق مثل تحديد الحزمة وقراءة ملفات mix.exs."},"useCases":{"en":["Releasing new versions to Hex","Bumping package versions","Preparing releases with manual verification"],"zh":["将新版本发布到 Hex","增加包版本","使用手动验证进行发布准备"],"ja":["Hex に新しいバージョンをリリースする","パッケージのバージョンを上げる","手動での検証とともにリリースを準備する"],"ko":["새 버전을 Hex에 릴리스","패키지 버전을 올리기","수동 확인과 함께 릴리스를 준비"],"es":["Publicar nuevas versiones en Hex","Actualizar versiones de paquetes","Preparar lanzamientos con verificación manual"],"fr":["Publier de nouvelles versions sur Hex","Mettre à jour les versions de packages","Préparer les publications avec vérification manuelle"],"de":["Veröffentlichung neuer Versionen in Hex","Aktualisieren von Paketversionen","Vorbereiten von Veröffentlichungen mit manueller Überprüfung"],"pt":["Lançar novas versões no Hex","Aumentar versões de pacotes","Preparar lançamentos com verificação manual"],"ru":["Выпускать новые версии в Hex","Повышать версии пакетов","Подготавливать релизы с ручной верификацией"],"ar":["إصدار إصدارات جديدة إلى هكس","رفع إصدارات الحزم","إعداد إصدارات مع التحقق اليدوي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires mix.exs file access","Limited to Hex package management","Supports automated and manual release paths via GitHub Actions and local workflows"],"zh":["需要访问 mix.exs 文件","仅限 Hex 包管理","通过 GitHub Actions 和本地工作流支持自动和手动发布路径"],"ja":["mix.exs ファイルへのアクセスが必要","Hex パッケージ管理に限定","GitHub Actions およびローカルワークフローを介した自動および手動のリリースパスをサポート"],"ko":["mix.exs 파일 액세스가 필요","Hex 패키지 관리에만 제한","GitHub Actions 및 로컬 워크플로우를 통해 자동 및 수동 릴리스 경로를 지원"],"es":["Requiere acceso al archivo mix.exs","Limitado a la gestión de paquetes Hex","Admite rutas de lanzamiento automático y manual a través de GitHub Actions y flujos de trabajo locales"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès au fichier mix.exs","Limité à la gestion de packages Hex","Prend en charge les chemins de publication automatisés et manuels via les GitHub Actions et les flux de travail locaux"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Datei mix.exs","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung von Hex-Paketen","Unterstützt automatisierte und manuelle Veröffentlichungspfade über GitHub Actions und lokale Workflows"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao arquivo mix.exs","Limitado ao gerenciamento de pacotes Hex","Suporta caminhos de lançamento automatizados e manuais via GitHub Actions e fluxos de trabalho locais"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлу mix.exs","Ограничен управлением пакетами Hex","Поддерживает автоматизированные и ручные пути выпуска через GitHub Actions и локальные рабочие процессы"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملف mix.exs","محدود لإدارة حزم هكس","يدعم مسارات الإصدار التلقائي واليدوي عبر إجراءات جيثب وأعمال التطوير المحلية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"e4dd7b750b4f89eabc6495c806fb2a618741335129f169ecce72c5eee7f3ddd0","qualityScore":60}');
