INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('agentjido/jido_signal/hex-release', 'hex-release', 'agentjido', 'jido_signal', 'community', 'hex-release agentjido jido_signal community The hex-release skill provides an interactive workflow for releasing Hex packages with manual verification. It supports automated and manual release paths, ideal for developers managing package versions. Hex Release 是一个用于发布 Hex 包的交互式工作流程，支持自动化和手动发布路径 Hex Release は Hex パッケージを公開するためのインタラクティブなワークフローです。自動化と手動のパスをサポート Hex Release는 Hex 패키지를 발행하는 데 사용되는 인터랙티브 워크플로우입니다. 자동화 및 수동 발행 경로 지원 hex-release es una herramienta de Inteligencia Artificial que automatiza el proceso de lanzamiento de paquetes en Hex con verificación manual. Soporta dos caminos de lanzamiento: automático y manual. hex-release est un outil d''Intelligence Artificielle qui automatise le processus de publication de packages sur Hex avec vérification manuelle. Il prend en charge deux chemins de publication : automatisé et manuel. hex-release ist ein KI-Tool, das den Prozess der Veröffentlichung von Paketen in Hex mit manueller Überprüfung automatisiert. Es unterstützt zwei Veröffentlichungspfade: automatisch und manuell. O Hex Release é uma ferramenta de envelope de comunicação de agente e utilitários para automatizar o lançamento de pacotes com verificação manual Hex Release - это инструмент для автоматизации выпуска пакетов с ручной проверкой, включающий коммуникационный конверт агента и утилиты Hex Release هي أداة غلاف اتصال الوكيل والمرافق لتحكم في إصدارات الحزم بفحص يدوي how to use hex-release hex-release setup guide automated package release hex-release alternative hex-release vs manual release github actions for hex-release hex-release install what is hex-release Hex Release AIエージェント工具 自动化发布 手动发布 GitHub Actions Hex 包发布 交互式工作流程 Supports automated release paths via GitHub Actions Enables manual release paths for local environments Performs pre-flight checks, including package identification via mix.exs Automates release tag creation and workflow triggering Allows for package version bumping and new version releases hex-release is an AI agent skill that enables interactive and automated workflows for releasing Hex packages, supporting both GitHub Actions and local environments.');
