aries, including a concise summary, title, and draft description, for use in multi-agent workflows.","zh":"PR Draft Summary是一种用于生成PR-ready摘要的框架","ja":"PR Draft SummaryはPR-readyサマリーを生成するためのフレームワークです","ko":"PR Draft Summary는 PR-ready 요약을 생성하기 위한 프레임워크입니다","es":"pr-draft-summary es un marco de software que genera resúmenes y descripciones de solicitudes de extracción para flujos de trabajo de agentes","fr":"pr-draft-summary est un cadre logiciel qui génère des résumés et des descriptions de demandes d''extraction pour les flux de travail d''agents","de":"pr-draft-summary ist ein Software-Framework, das Zusammenfassungen und Beschreibungen für Pull-Requests in Multi-Agent-Workflows generiert","pt":"O pr-draft-summary é um framework que gera resumos concisos e títulos de PR prontos para paste em repositórios de código","ru":"Pr-draft-summary - это фреймворк, который генерирует краткие резюме и заголовки PR, готовые для вставки в репозитории кода","ar":"pr-draft-summary هو إطار عمل يولد ملخصات موجزة وأسماء PR جاهزة لللصق في مستودعات Код"},"features":{"en":["Generates PR-ready title and draft description","Produces concise summary for openai-agents-python","Automates PR summary generation after substantive code work","Supports runtime code, tests, examples, docs, and build/test configuration","Triggers after task completion or when ready for review"],"zh":["支持多agent工作流","轻量级框架","生成PR-ready标题和摘要","支持runtime代码、测试、示例和文档","支持构建和测试配置"],"ja":["マルチエージェントワークフローをサポート","軽量級フレームワーク","PR-readyタイトルとサマリーを生成","runtimeコード、テスト、例とドキュメントをサポート","ビルドとテスト設定をサポート"],"ko":["멀티 에이전트 워크플로우 지원","경량화된 프레임워크","PR-ready 제목과 요약 생성","런타임 코드, 테스트, 예제 및 문서 지원","빌드 및 테스트 설정 지원"],"es":["Generación de resúmenes concisos para solicitudes de extracción","Creación de títulos y descripciones de PR para openai-agents-python","Compatibilidad con flujos de trabajo de agentes","Integración con código de runtime, pruebas y configuración de compilación","Generación de bloques de texto listos para pegar en solicitudes de extracción"],"fr":["Génération de résumés concis pour les demandes d''extraction","Création de titres et de descriptions de PR pour openai-agents-python","Compatibilité avec les flux de travail d''agents","Intégration avec le code de runtime, les tests et la configuration de build","Génération de blocs de texte prêts à coller dans les demandes d''extraction"],"de":["Erstellung von präzisen Zusammenfassungen für Pull-Requests","Erzeugung von Titeln und Beschreibungen für PR in openai-agents-python","Unterstützung von Multi-Agent-Workflows","Integration mit Laufzeitcode, Tests und Build-Konfiguration","Erzeugung von Textblöcken, die bereit sind, in Pull-Requests eingefügt zu werden"],"pt":["Geração de resumos concisos","Criação de títulos de PR prontos para paste","Integração com repositórios de código","Suporte a fluxos de trabalho de multi-agente","Compatibilidade com runtime code, tests, examples e docs"],"ru":["Генерация кратких резюме","Создание заголовков PR, готовых для вставки","Интеграция с репозиториями кода","Поддержка многопоточных рабочих процессов","Совместимость с runtime code, tests, examples и docs"],"ar":["GENERATION ملخصات موجزة","إنشاء أسماء PR جاهزة لللصق","التكامل مع مستودعات Код","دعم تدفقات العمل متعددة الوكلاء","التوافق مع runtime code, tests, examples و docs"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use pr-draft-summary","pr-draft-summary setup guide","pr-draft-summary alternative","what is pr-draft-summary","pr-draft-summary vs manual PR summary","pr-draft-summary install for AI agents"],"zh":["AIエージェント","多agent工作流","PR Draft Summary","代码审查","轻量级框架","Python开发","代码效率"],"ja":["AIエージェント","マルチエージェントワークフロー","PR Draft Summary","コードレビュー","軽量級フレームワーク","Python開発","コード効率"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","멀티 에이전트 워크플로우","PR Draft Summary","코드 리뷰","경량화된 프레임워크","Python 개발","코드 효율"],"es":["pr-draft-summary","flujos de trabajo de agentes","desarrollo de software","openai-agents-python","solicitudes de extracción","resúmenes concisos","títulos y descripciones de PR","Herramientas de desarrollo de software","Agentes de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["pr-draft-summary","flux de travail d''agents","développement logiciel","openai-agents-python","demandes d''extraction","résumés concis","titres et descriptions de PR","Outils de développement logiciel","Agents d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["pr-draft-summary","Multi-Agent-Workflows","Software-Entwicklung","openai-agents-python","Pull-Requests","präzise Zusammenfassungen","Titel und Beschreibungen von PR","Software-Entwicklungstools","Künstliche Intelligenz Agenten"],"pt":["pr-draft-summary","ferramentas de ia","fluxos de trabalho de multi-agente","resumos concisos","títulos de pr","repositórios de código","runtime code","tests","examples","docs"],"ru":["pr-draft-summary","ии агенты","многопоточные рабочие процессы","краткие резюме","заголовки пр","репозитории кода","runtime code","tests","examples","docs"],"ar":["pr-draft-summary","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تدفقات العمل متعددة الوكلاء","ملخصات موجزة","أسماء پر","مستودعات Код","runtime code","tests","examples","docs"]}},"owner":"openai","repo":"openai-agents-python","repoPath":"openai/openai-agents-python","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.327Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pr-draft-summary","description":"Create a PR title and draft description after substantive code changes are finished. Trigger when wrapping up a moderate-or-larger change (runtime code, tests, build config, docs with behavior impact) and you need the PR-ready summary block with change summary plus PR draft text.","bodyPreview":"# PR Draft Summary\n\n## Purpose\nProduce the PR-ready summary required in this repository after substantive code work is complete: a concise summary plus a PR-ready title and draft description that begins with \"This pull request <verb> ...\". The block should be ready to paste into a PR for openai-agents-python.\n\n## When to Trigger\n- The task for this repo is finished (or ready for review) and it touched runtime code, tests, examples, docs with behavior impact, or build/test configuration.\n- You ar","body":"# PR Draft Summary\n\n## Purpose\nProduce the PR-ready summary required in this repository after substantive code work is complete: a concise summary plus a PR-ready title and draft description that begins with \"This pull request <verb> ...\". The block should be ready to paste into a PR for openai-agents-python.\n\n## When to Trigger\n- The task for this repo is finished (or ready for review) and it touched runtime code, tests, examples, docs with behavior impact, or build/test configuration.\n- You are about to send the \"work complete\" response and need the PR block included.\n- Skip only for trivial or conversation-only tasks where no PR-style summary is expected.\n\n## Inputs to Collect Automatically (do not ask the user)\n- Current branch: `git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD`.\n- Working tree: `git status -sb`.\n- Untracked files: `git ls-files --others --exclude-standard` (use with `git status -sb` to ensure they are surfaced; `--stat` does not include them).\n- Changed files: `git diff --name-only` (unstaged) and `git diff --name-only --cached` (staged); sizes via `git diff --stat` and `git diff --stat --cached`.\n- Latest release tag (prefer remote-aware lookup): `LATEST_RELEASE_TAG=$(.agents/skills/final-release-review/scripts/find_latest_release_tag.sh origin ''v*'' 2>/dev/null || git tag -l ''v*'' --sort=-v:refname | head -n1)`.\n- Base reference (use the branch''s upstream, fallback to `origin/main`):\n  - `BASE_REF=$(git rev-parse --abbrev-ref --symbolic-full-name @{upstream} 2>/dev/null || echo origin/main)`.\n  - `BASE_COMMIT=$(git merge-base --fork-point \"$BASE_REF\" HEAD || git merge-base \"$BASE_REF\" HEAD || echo \"$BASE_REF\")`.\n- Commits ahead of the base fork point: `git log --oneline --no-merges ${BASE_COMMIT}..HEAD`.\n- Category signals for this repo: runtime (`src/agents/`), tests (`tests/`), examples (`examples/`), docs (`docs/`, `mkdocs.yml`), build/test config (`pyproject.toml`, `uv.lock`, `Makefile`, `.github/`).\n\n## Workflow\n1) Run the commands above without asking the user; compute `BASE_REF`/`BASE_COMMIT` first so later commands reuse them.\n2) If there are no staged/unstaged/untracked changes and no commits ahead of `${BASE_COMMIT}`, reply briefly that no code changes were detected and skip emitting the PR block.\n3) Infer change type from the touched paths listed under \"Category signals\"; classify as feature, fix, refactor, or docs-with-impact, and flag backward-compatibility risk only when the diff changes released public APIs, external config, persisted data, serialized state, or wire protocols. Judge that risk against `LATEST_RELEASE_TAG`, not unreleased branch-only churn.\n4) Summarize changes in 1–3 short sentences using the key paths (top 5) and `git diff --stat` output; explicitly call out untracked files from `git status -sb`/`git ls-files --others --exclude-standard` because `--stat` does not include them. If the working tree is clean but there are commits ahead of `${BASE_COMMIT}`, summarize using those commit messages.\n5) Choose the lead verb for the description: feature → `adds`, bug fix → `fixes`, refactor/perf → `improves` or `updates`, docs-only → `updates`.\n6) Suggest a branch name. If already off main, keep it; otherwise propose `feat/<slug>`, `fix/<slug>`, or `docs/<slug>` based on the primary area (e.g., `docs/pr-draft-summary-guidance`).\n7) If the current branch matches `issue-<number>` (digits only), keep that branch suggestion. Optionally pull light issue context (for example via the GitHub API) when available, but do not block or retry if it is not. When an issue number is present, reference `https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/issues/<number>` and include an auto-closing line such as `This pull request resolves #<number>.`.\n8) Draft the PR title and description using the template below.\n9) Output only the block in \"Output Format\". Keep any surrounding status note minimal and in English.\n\n## Output Format\nWhen closing out a task and the summary block is desired, add this concise Markdown block (English only) after any brief status note. If the user says they do not want it, skip this section.\n\n```\n# Pull Request Draft\n\n## Branch name suggestion\n\ngit checkout -b <kebab-case suggestion, e.g., feat/pr-draft-summary-skill>\n\n## Title\n\n<single-line imperative title, which can be a commit message; if a common prefix like chore: and feat: etc., having them is preferred>\n\n## Description\n\n<include what you changed plus a draft pull request title and description for your local changes; start the description with prose such as \"This pull request resolves/updates/adds ...\" using a verb that matches the change (you can use bullets later), explain the change background (for bugs, clearly describe the bug, symptoms, or repro; for features, what is needed and why), any behavior changes or considerations to be aware of, and you do not need to mention tests you ran.>\n```\n\nKeep it tight—no redundant prose around the block, and avoid repeating details between `Changes` and the description. Tests do not need to be listed unless specifically requested.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:03.929Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing automated PR summary generation for openai-agents-python repository.","zh":"非常适合需要为 openai-agents-python 仓库自动化生成 PR 摘要的代码审查代理。","ja":"openai-agents-python リポジトリの自動化された PR 要約生成を必要とするコードレビュー エージェントに最適です。","ko":"openai-agents-python 저장소에 자동화된 PR 요약 생성이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan una generación automática de resumen de PR para el repositorio openai-agents-python.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une génération automatisée de résumé de PR pour le référentiel openai-agents-python.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine automatisierte PR-Zusammenfassungsgenerierung für das openai-agents-python-Repository benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que precisam de geração automática de resumo de PR para o repositório openai-agents-python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, которым требуется автоматизированная генерация сводки PR для репозитория openai-agents-python.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراقبين للкод الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد تلخيص自动ي ل-PR لمستودع openai-agents-python."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate concise PR-ready summaries, titles, and draft descriptions using Python, streamlining the pull request process for openai-agents-python with substantive code work, including runtime code, tests, examples, docs, and build/test configuration.","zh":"赋予代理生成使用 Python 的简洁 PR 准备摘要、标题和草稿描述，简化 openai-agents-python 中实质性代码工作的拉取请求过程，包括运行时代码、测试、示例、文档和构建/测试配置。","ja":"Python を使用して、エージェントが簡潔な PR 準備要約、タイトル、下書き説明を生成できるようにし、openai-agents-python の実質的なコード作業、実行時コード、テスト、例、ドキュメント、ビルド/テスト構成を含むプルリクエストプロセスを合理化します。","ko":"에이전트가 Python을 사용하여 간결한 PR 준비 요약, 제목 및 초안 설명을 생성할 수 있도록 하여 openai-agents-python의 실질적인 코드 작업, 런타임 코드, 테스트, 예제, 문서 및 빌드/테스트 구성 включ을 포함한 풀 리퀘스트 프로세스를 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar resúmenes concisos y listos para PR, títulos y descripciones de borrador utilizando Python, simplificando el proceso de solicitud de extracción para openai-agents-python con trabajo de código sustantivo, incluyendo código de tiempo de ejecución, pruebas, ejemplos, documentación y configuración de compilación/pruebas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des résumés concis et prêts pour PR, des titres et des descriptions de brouillon à l''aide de Python, en simplifiant le processus de demande d''extraction pour openai-agents-python avec un travail de code substantiel, y compris le code d''exécution, les tests, les exemples, la documentation et la configuration de build/test.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, präzise und PR-fertige Zusammenfassungen, Titel und Entwurfsbeschreibungen mit Python zu generieren, wodurch der Pull-Request-Prozess für openai-agents-python mit wesentlichen Codearbeiten, einschließlich Laufzeitcode, Tests, Beispielen, Dokumentation und Build-/Testkonfiguration, rationalisiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar resumos concisos prontos para PR, títulos e descrições de rascunho usando Python, otimizando o processo de solicitação de pull para openai-agents-python com trabalhos de código substantivos, incluindo código de tempo de execução, testes, exemplos, docs e configuração de build/teste.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать краткие сводки, готовые к PR, заголовки и черновые описания с использованием Python, оптимизируя процесс запроса на слияние для openai-agents-python с существенными работами по коду, включая код времени выполнения, тесты, примеры, документацию и конфигурацию сборки/тестирования.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد تلخيصات موجزة وجاهزة ل-PR والأ별 والوصف المسود باستخدام Python، ويتوافق مع عملية طلب السحب لمستودع openai-agents-python مع أعمال شاملة للكود، بما في ذلك كود زمن التشغيل والاختبارات والأمثلة والتوثيق وتكوين البناء والاختبار."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating PR summary generation after code updates","Generating PR-ready titles and descriptions for openai-agents-python","Simplifying the PR process for developers with ready-to-paste summaries"],"zh":["代码更新后自动化 PR 摘要生成","为 openai-agents-python 生成 PR 准备标题和描述","简化开发人员的 PR 过程，提供即插即用的摘要"],"ja":["コード更新後の PR 要約の自動化生成","openai-agents-python の PR 準備タイトルと説明の生成","開発者の PR プロセスの簡素化、すなわちすでに用意された要約"],"ko":["코드 업데이트 후 자동화된 PR 요약 생성","openai-agents-python의 PR 준비 제목 및 설명 생성","개발자의 PR 프로세스 단순화, 즉시 사용 가능한 요약 제공"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de resúmenes de PR después de las actualizaciones de código","Generar títulos y descripciones listas para PR para openai-agents-python","Simplificar el proceso de PR para los desarrolladores con resúmenes listos para pegar"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération de résumés de PR après les mises à jour de code","Générer des titres et des descriptions prêts pour PR pour openai-agents-python","Simplifier le processus de PR pour les développeurs avec des résumés prêts à coller"],"de":["Automatisieren der Generierung von PR-Zusammenfassungen nach Codeaktualisierungen","Generieren von PR-fertigen Titeln und Beschreibungen für openai-agents-python","Vereinfachen des PR-Prozesses für Entwickler mit bereit zur Einfügung stehenden Zusammenfassungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de resumo de PR após atualizações de código","Gerar títulos e descrições prontas para PR para openai-agents-python","Simplificar o processo de PR para desenvolvedores com resumos prontos para colar"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию сводки PR после обновлений кода","Генерировать заголовки и описания, готовые к PR, для openai-agents-python","Упрощать процесс PR для разработчиков с готовыми к вставке сводками"],"ar":["توفير آلي لتوليد تلخيص ل-PR بعد تحديثات الكود","توليد ألقاب ووصف جاهزة ل-PR لمستودع openai-agents-python","تبسيط عملية ل-PR للمطورين مع تلخيصات جاهزة للصق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Specific to openai-agents-python repository","Requires substantive code work completion"],"zh":["仅限 openai-agents-python 仓库","需要完成实质性代码工作"],"ja":["openai-agents-python リポジトリのみに適用","実質的なコード作業の完了が必要"],"ko":["openai-agents-python 저장소에만 적용","실질적인 코드 작업 완성이 필요"],"es":["Específico del repositorio openai-agents-python","Requiere la finalización del trabajo de código sustantivo"],"fr":["Spécifique au référentiel openai-agents-python","Nécessite l''achèvement du travail de code substantiel"],"de":["Spezifisch für das openai-agents-python-Repository","Benötigt die Fertigstellung der wesentlichen Codearbeiten"],"pt":["Específico para o repositório openai-agents-python","Exige conclusão de trabalhos de código substantivos"],"ru":["Конкретно для репозитория openai-agents-python","Требует завершения существенных работ по коду"],"ar":["محدد لمستودع openai-agents-python","يتطلب إكمال أعمال شاملة للكود"]},"version":4},"contentH