INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('Sunalamye/Naki/mcp-tool-writer', 'mcp-tool-writer', 'Sunalamye', 'Naki', 'community', 'mcp-tool-writer Sunalamye Naki community The mcp-tool-writer skill helps developers create and modify MCP tools for the Naki project using Swift and Core ML. It benefits developers working on AI-powered projects. mcp-tool-writer 是一个使用 Swift 和 Core ML 实现的 MCP 工具创建和修改的技能，支持 Protocol-based 架构 mcp-tool-writer は、Swift と Core ML を使用して MCP ツールを作成および変更するスキルです。Protocol-based アーキテクチャをサポートしています mcp-tool-writer는 Swift와 Core ML을 사용하여 MCP 도구를 생성하고 수정하는 스킬로, Protocol-based 아키텍처를 지원합니다 mcp-tool-writer es una herramienta para crear y modificar herramientas MCP con arquitectura basada en protocolos mcp-tool-writer est un outil pour créer et modifier des outils MCP avec une architecture basée sur les protocoles mcp-tool-writer ist ein Tool zum Erstellen und Modifizieren von MCP-Tools mit einer protokollbasierten Architektur O mcp-tool-writer é uma ferramenta para criar e modificar ferramentas MCP com arquitetura baseada em protocolos e Swift. Aprenda a configurá-la para o seu projeto. Mcp-tool-writer - это инструмент для создания и изменения инструментов MCP с помощью архитектуры, основанной на протоколах, и ИИ Агентов. Узнайте, как настроить его для своего проекта. mcp-tool-writer هي أداة لإنشاء وتعديل أدوات MCP باستخدام هندسة بروتوكول قائم على Swift. اكتشف كيفية إعدادها لمشروعك. how to use mcp-tool-writer mcp-tool-writer setup guide mcp-tool-writer alternative mcp-tool-writer vs Core ML what is mcp-tool-writer mcp-tool-writer install for Naki project mcp-tool-writer Swift Core ML MCP 工具 Protocol-based 架构 AI 工具 Swift开发 Core ML开发 Utilizes Protocol-based architecture for MCP tool development Supports Swift and Core ML for AI-powered projects Creates and modifies MCP tools using MCPTool.swift and MCPContext.swift Leverages MCPToolRegistry.swift for tool registration Follows MCP 调用规则 for testing and development mcp-tool-writer is a skill that enables the creation and modification of Model Context Protocol tools for the Naki project using a Protocol-based architecture.');
